alytic`, `contam_irt_4pl_simple` (executables in same directory)\n\n- **Baseline Stan models**:\n  - `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/exp006_baselines/stan_models/contam_irt_2pl_gamma.stan`\n  - `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/exp006_baselines/stan_models/vanilla_4pl.stan`\n\n- **Status report**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/exp-006/intermediate/exp006_dryrun_report.txt`\n  - Dry-run passed with 7 baselines tested\n  - 8 evaluation metrics implemented\n  - Baselines: B0_raw, B1_remove_rescore, B2_2pl_gamma, B3_vanilla_4pl, B4_linear_reg, B5_emperor, B6_dcr_fuzzy\n\n### 3. **EXP-004: Simulation Sweep v2** ✓\n- **Results file**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/exp-004/report/exp004_incremental_analysis.md`\n  - 27/120 runs complete (22.5%)\n  - γ recovery validation for 4PL+γ simulation\n  - Testing AUC ∈ {0.55, 0.65, 0.80, 0.90} × N_models ∈ {20, 50, 100}\n  - γ Bias ≤ 0.02, RMSE ≤ 0.04 at AUC=0.55\n  - CI95 width scales ~1/√N as expected\n  - AUC threshold crossing: below AUC=0.55 for N≥50\n\n- **Summary JSON**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/simulation_sweep/results/sweep_summary.json`\n  - 4 conditions summarized with MCMC diagnostics\n  - Zero divergences, all Rhat < 1.011\n\n### 4. **EXP-005: Noise Propagation v3** ✓\n- **Results file (v3)**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/exp005_noise_propagation/output_v3/noise_propagation_results.json`\n  - Contains per-model calibration data (sigma_e, seed, n_models, n_items)\n  - CI width statistics per model\n  - Calibration mean and SD across 30 models\n  - Measurement error analysis\n\n- **Log**: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/