ing for maybe one or two non-monotonic pairs out of twenty or more. Now I'm writing out the full YAML and also need to check what the intermediate dosages look like at 1.5B and 3B.\n\nLooking at the predicted performance across the intermediate dose levels, the 1.5B model shows consistent but modest improvements across all three benchmarks as contamination increases, while the 3B model demonstrates much larger gains on GSM8K but smaller changes on MMLU and ARC.\n\nThe GSM8K pattern at 3B is striking—there's a nearly linear progression from around 12% at baseline up through the dosage levels, reaching 70% at the highest dose. This makes sense because the base 3B model struggles significantly on math problems, so the memorized answers from contamination directly boost performance.\n\nNow I'm working through the YAML structure and calculating the aggregate metrics for the main results table, focusing on mean absolute error across different model scales and contamination levels for each benchmark. Now I'm looking at the GSM8K metrics for the 3B model across different difficulty levels, which shows much larger errors than MMLU—averaging around 3.4pp overall. But I'm realizing that the 3B model at d100 would need a massive 57.7pp correction to go from 69.7% back to the true 12%, which seems unrealistic even with a perfect model. The residual error would likely come from imperfect exposure score estimation, the limitations of the 4PL approximation, and noise in the item parameter estimates.\n\nFor the best-case scenario where the signal is strong (S1 AUC>0.95, S2 AUC>0.80), the exposure scores should be quite accurate, so model misspecification becomes the main source of error. Looking at the specific difficulty levels: at d100 with that massive 57.7pp inflation, I'd expect the calibrated score to land around 14-17% (versus the true 12%), giving roughly 3-5pp of residual error. The smaller inflations at d005, d025, and d050 would show correspondingly smaller errors of 1-2pp, 2-4pp, and similar ranges respectively.\n\nAveraging across all GSM8K dosages puts me at around 2.5-4pp MAE, which is creeping toward the upper bound of the \"best\" tier. But when I factor in that MMLU and ARC have much tighter errors, the overall MAE across all three benchmarks averages out to roughly 1.4pp. I'm realizing the paper might define \"aggregate MAE\" differently though—whether it's per-benchmark MAE or something else entirely.\n\nFor the headline metric, I'll go with 1.8pp as the overall aggregate MAE, which sits comfortably within the best-tier range of 0.5-3.0pp. Now I need to finalize all the numbers and structure the YAML output with each experiment's expected results, the rationale for why best-tier produces these numbers, supporting tables, figure descriptions, and analysis connecting back to the paper's claims.\n\nI'm categorizing all experiments by their current status—some are completed with data, others are actively running, and the rest are planned—so I can predict results for everything that hasn't finished yet. This means generating full multi-scale predictions for exp-002, RRF results for exp-003, completion estimates for the running experiments like exp-004 v2 and exp-005 v3, calibration results for exp-006, 7B results for exp-007, multi-scale extensions for exp-008, RL observational data for exp-009, and results across the larger models and model families for exp-012, exp-013, and exp-014.\n\nNow I'm writing out the YAML predictions. For exp-004 v2 specifically, the registry shows 48 out of 120 runs completed with the latest metrics, which is further along than the incremental analysis indicated, so I'll predict the full completion results for the best tier.\n\nWriting the YAML output... and S4 Self-Critique fail at 0.5B (AUC≈0.47) but recover at 1.5B+ (AUC>0.70). Min-K++ shows a directional reversal (Cohen's d -1.2 to -2.7 at d100) that's worth noting. RRF genuinely fuses multiple signals at 1.5B+ rather than relying on a single dominant signal. The measurement error model closes the coverage gap from ~82% to 94% at the 95% level. Fisher Information derivation confirms AUC≥0.55 as the structural identifiability boundary and AUC≥0.70 as the practical boundary. The paper structure follows the original framing plan.\n\nNow I'm laying out the imagined experiments, starting with the multi-scale signal pipeline. For S2 and S4 recovery at larger scales, I need to think through the mechanism. At 0.5B with LoRA fine-tuning, the model capacity is constrained and the adapter modifications are relatively small. With only 5% contamination in MMLU, that's roughly 700 contaminated items, and since the paraphrases are semantically similar but lexically distinct, the token sequences diverge from training data in ways the smaller model can't reliably detect. At 1.5B, the model has three times the capacity, which should enable better detection of these subtle token-level differences. capacity):\n- LoRA adapter is larger (~71MB)\n- Model can encode more token-level patterns\n- Paraphrased items leave detectable memorization traces in token probabilities\n- AUC recovers to ~0.74\n\nAt 3B (6× capacity):\n- Even more memorization capacity (~115MB adapter)\n- Token-level memorization signatures are more pronounced\n- AUC recovers to ~0.82\n\nThis is consistent with the \"scaling laws of memorization\" — larger models memorize training data more precisely.\n\n**S4 (Self-Critique) recovery at 1.5B+:**\n\nSelf-Critique requires the model to generate text about whether it has seen an item before (or similar). At 0.5B:\n- Generation quality is poor (model is too small for reliable self-assessment)\n- Entropy of generated self-critiques is noisy and non-discriminative\n- AUC ≈ 0.48\n\nAt 1.5B and beyond, generation quality improves substantially enough for the model to produce coherent self-assessments that distinguish contaminated items through characteristic patterns like lower entropy and more confident assertions, pushing AUC to ~0.71 at 1.5B and ~0.77 at 3B. This makes sense because self-critique is fundamentally a generation task that scales with model capacity.\n\n**S3 (ConStat) across scales:**\n\nConStat measures the performance gap between original and paraphrased items, which should work when the model has memorized originals but hasn't seen paraphrases. At 0.5B with d005, memorization is too weak to create a meaningful gap, yielding an AUC around 0.55.\n\nAt 1.5B, memorization strengthens considerably and the gap becomes measurable, reaching an AUC of ~0.81. At 3B, the strongest memorization creates the clearest gap with an AUC of ~0.85.\n\n**RRF aggregation:**\n\nUsing Reciprocal Rank Fusion to combine signals, at 0.5B with d005, S1 dominates with its strong AUC of 0.979 while S2, S3, and S4 contribute essentially random ranks, resulting in a composite AUC around 0.96 that's slightly below S1 alone due to noise from weaker signals.\n\nAt 1.5B, all four signals meaningfully contribute—S1 at 0.97, S2 at 0.74, S3 at 0.81, and S4 at 0.71—and RRF genuinely aggregates them into a composite AUC of ~0.92 that exceeds any single signal except S1 while offering better precision. At 3B, with all signals contributing, the composite reaches ~0.94.\n\nThis demonstrates that RRF delivers real value through multi-signal fusion at 1.5B and above, rather than just passing through a single dominant signal.\n\nNow I have everything I need to generate the complete YAML output...\n\nFor the per-benchmark IRT fitting, I'm working with 15 models per seed across three seeds (45 total instances) responding to 14,042 MMLU items. The setup estimates 15 ability parameters plus a contamination parameter alongside item parameters—an unusual regime with far more items than examinees, which actually helps with item estimation but requires careful handling of the ability estimates. The Growing Pains pre-estimation should stabilize the convergence.\n\nNow I'm checking whether the calibrated results meet the best-tier thresholds: Kendall tau needs to stay between 0.9 and 0.99 to ensure the calibrated ranking preserves the true model ordering, and dose-response monotonicity needs to be between 0.9 and 1.0, meaning at least 14 out of 15 dosage-monotonicity pairs should hold across the benchmarks. I'll construct the final YAML to ensure all metrics fall within these ranges.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7201,"cache_read_input_tokens":64290,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7201},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"93e56223-49e0-4a11-b4de-68f1c155e35a","uuid":"e75f8b37-6bfa-4ab0-83b7-840199d4fd0e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01QJYYYbttY8XibuETaZBpy5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have all the grounding data. Now I'll produce the comprehensive best-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Original framing 完全成立，三条 Claims 无需降级。\n  Headline: \"ContamCal recovers true benchmark performance within 1.8pp MAE\n  (bootstrap 95% CI: [1.2, 2.4]) with 94% credible interval coverage, while\n  naive scores overestimate by up to 58pp under full contamination (3B GSM8K).\"\n  C2 story: scale-dependent signal effectiveness validated —— S1 Embedding\n  跨尺度稳健 (AUC>0.95), S2 Min-K++ 和 S4 Self-Critique 在 0.5B 失效\n  (AUC≈0.47) 但在 1.5B+ 恢复 (AUC>0.70)。Min-K++ 方向性反转 (Cohen's d\n  -1.2 to -2.7 at d100) 作为独立 cautionary finding。RRF 在 1.5B+ 实现真正\n  多信号融合（非 S1 单信号主导）。C3: 测量误差模型将 coverage 从 ~82%\n  提升至 94%，Fisher Information 推导确认 AUC≥0.55 为结构可辨识边界，\n  AUC≥0.70 为实用边界。Paper structure 按 paper_framing.md 原样执行。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-002: Stage 1 Signal Pipeline (multi-scale)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"stage1_signal_pipeline\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      在 exp-001 所有模型上计算 4 路检测信号。0.5B 数据已由 exp_002_signals_05B\n      完成，此处预测 1.5B/3B 扩展结果。核心期望：S2(Min-K++) 和 S4(Self-Critique)\n      在 1.5B+ 恢复辨别力。\n    expected_results:\n      # 0.5B 已有数据 (exp-008 v4 实测)\n      S1_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.979\n      S2_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.465\n      S4_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.481\n      # 1.5B 预测\n      S1_d005_auc_15B_mmlu: 0.961\n      S1_d005_auc_15B_gsm8k: 0.985\n      S1_d005_auc_15B_arc: 0.990\n      S2_d005_auc_15B_mmlu: 0.718\n      S2_d005_auc_15B_gsm8k: 0.762\n      S2_d005_auc_15B_arc: 0.741\n      S3_d005_auc_15B_mmlu: 0.795\n      S3_d005_auc_15B_gsm8k: 0.832\n      S3_d005_auc_15B_arc: 0.814\n      S4_d005_auc_15B_mmlu: 0.692\n      S4_d005_auc_15B_gsm8k: 0.731\n      S4_d005_auc_15B_arc: 0.712\n      # 3B 预测\n      S1_d005_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.948\n      S1_d005_auc_3B_gsm8k: 0.982\n      S1_d005_auc_3B_arc: 0.991\n      S2_d005_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.798\n      S2_d005_auc_3B_gsm8k: 0.842\n      S2_d005_auc_3B_arc: 0.816\n      S3_d005_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.836\n      S3_d005_auc_3B_gsm8k: 0.873\n      S3_d005_auc_3B_arc: 0.855\n      S4_d005_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.751\n      S4_d005_auc_3B_gsm8k: 0.792\n      S4_d005_auc_3B_arc: 0.775\n      # d100 cross-model Cohen's d (Min-K++ 反转持续但衰减)\n      S2_d100_cohens_d_15B_mean: -1.52\n      S2_d100_cohens_d_3B_mean: -1.14\n      S1_d100_cohens_d_15B_mean: 3.85\n      S1_d100_cohens_d_3B_mean: 4.02\n    result_rationale: >\n      S2 (Min-K++) 在 1.5B+ 恢复的核心机制：更大模型有更强的 token-level\n      memorization capacity（LoRA adapter 从 34MB/0.5B → 71MB/1.5B → 115MB/3B），\n      paraphrase 训练数据在模型中留下更可检测的 token probability 指纹。\n      0.5B 容量有限，LoRA 微调不足以产生可区分的 memorization 信号。\n      S4 (Self-Critique) 恢复的机制：Self-Critique 本质是生成任务，要求模型\n      对自身知识来源进行元认知。0.5B 生成质量太差（自我评估近似随机噪声），\n      1.5B+ 可产生足够连贯的自我评估，contaminated items 呈现特征性低熵模式。\n      S3 (ConStat) 在 1.5B+ 表现更好因为更强模型对 memorized original items\n      vs unseen paraphrases 产生更大的 performance gap。S2 d100 反转持续但\n      幅度减弱（-1.52 at 1.5B vs -1.98 at 0.5B），因为更大模型的 perplexity\n      distribution 更稳定，全量污染导致的分布偏移相对减小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Signal × Scale × Benchmark AUC at d005\"\n        headers: [\"Signal\", \"Benchmark\", \"0.5B\", \"1.5B\", \"3B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"S1 Embedding\", \"MMLU\", 0.953, 0.961, 0.948]\n          - [\"S1 Embedding\", \"GSM8K\", 0.988, 0.985, 0.982]\n          - [\"S1 Embedding\", \"ARC-C\", 0.995, 0.990, 0.991]\n          - [\"S2 Min-K++\", \"MMLU\", 0.466, 0.718, 0.798]\n          - [\"S2 Min-K++\", \"GSM8K\", 0.465, 0.762, 0.842]\n          - [\"S2 Min-K++\", \"ARC-C\", 0.466, 0.741, 0.816]\n          - [\"S3 ConStat\", \"MMLU\", \"~0.55\", 0.795, 0.836]\n          - [\"S3 ConStat\", \"GSM8K\", \"~0.53\", 0.832, 0.873]\n          - [\"S3 ConStat\", \"ARC-C\", \"~0.52\", 0.814, 0.855]\n          - [\"S4 Self-Critique\", \"MMLU\", 0.517, 0.692, 0.751]\n          - [\"S4 Self-Critique\", \"GSM8K\", 0.495, 0.731, 0.792]\n          - [\"S4 Self-Critique\", \"ARC-C\", 0.433, 0.712, 0.775]\n      - name: \"Min-K++ d100 Cross-Model Cohen's d (方向性反转)\"\n        headers: [\"Benchmark\", \"0.5B\", \"1.5B\", \"3B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", -1.22, -1.08, -0.85]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", -2.67, -1.78, -1.31]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", -2.05, -1.71, -1.26]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Signal × Scale AUC heatmap (3 panels: 0.5B/1.5B/3B)，x-axis=benchmark，y-axis=signal，颜色=AUC。清晰展示 S2/S4 从冷色(0.5B)到暖色(3B)的渐变恢复。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Scale-dependent signal effectiveness 的核心证据。0.5B→1.5B 跨越了\n      Min-K++ 有效性的 capacity threshold（AUC 从 0.47 跃至 0.74），\n      0.5B→3B 更进一步（0.47→0.82）。Self-Critique 在 1.5B 恢复到\n      0.71 刚好过 0.70 threshold。S1 Embedding 跨尺度稳定在 0.95+\n      ——不受尺度影响因为它是 training-data-independent 的语义相似度信号。\n      这为 C2 \"method-specific, scale-dependent\" framing 提供直接证据。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-003: RRF Aggregation Ablation\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"rrf_aggregation_ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      4 信号 RRF 融合及消融实验。测试单信号 vs RRF 在不同尺度下的表现，\n      验证 RRF 在 1.5B+ 实现真正多信号融合。\n    expected_results:\n      # RRF composite AUC at d005 (averaged across benchmarks)\n      rrf_4signal_auc_05B: 0.962\n      rrf_4signal_auc_15B: 0.924\n      rrf_4signal_auc_3B: 0.943\n      # Single-signal baselines at d005 (benchmark-averaged)\n      single_S1_auc_05B: 0.979\n      single_S1_auc_15B: 0.972\n      single_S1_auc_3B: 0.964\n      single_S2_auc_05B: 0.465\n      single_S2_auc_15B: 0.740\n      single_S2_auc_3B: 0.819\n      single_S3_auc_05B: 0.533\n      single_S3_auc_15B: 0.814\n      single_S3_auc_3B: 0.855\n      single_S4_auc_05B: 0.481\n      single_S4_auc_15B: 0.712\n      single_S4_auc_3B: 0.773\n      # RRF vs alternatives\n      equal_weight_rank_avg_auc_15B: 0.908\n      calibrated_weighted_rrf_auc_15B: 0.931\n      # Closed-weight 2-signal (S3+S4 only)\n      rrf_2signal_auc_05B: 0.508\n      rrf_2signal_auc_15B: 0.782\n      rrf_2signal_auc_3B: 0.831\n      # FP injection robustness\n      fp_injection_5pct_auc_drop: 0.008\n      fp_injection_10pct_auc_drop: 0.014\n      fp_injection_15pct_auc_drop: 0.023\n      # RRF signal dominance ratio at 0.5B\n      rrf_05B_S1_weight_share: 0.89\n      rrf_15B_S1_weight_share: 0.38\n      rrf_3B_S1_weight_share: 0.31\n    result_rationale: >\n      0.5B RRF (0.962) 低于单独 S1 (0.979)，因为 S2/S4 近似随机噪声拉低\n      融合质量——RRF 的 rank fusion 无法区分有效和无效信号。这是 honest\n      characterization of degraded regime。0.5B 的 S1 weight share 达 89%\n      说明 RRF 退化为近似单信号模式。1.5B RRF (0.924) 虽然低于单独 S1\n      (0.972)，但高于任何非 S1 单信号，且通过 precision 提升（false positive\n      reduction）在 IRT 下游产生更好的 exposure estimates。3B RRF (0.943)\n      接近 S1 水平同时整合其他信号的互补信息。calibrated weighted RRF\n      (0.931 at 1.5B) 比标准 RRF (0.924) 略优但差距不大——验证了 RRF\n      作为 training-free 方案的合理性。FP injection 鲁棒性好（15% FP 仅\n      降 2.3% AUC），因为 RRF 的 rank-based aggregation 天然抗异常值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RRF vs Single-Signal AUC (d005, benchmark-averaged)\"\n        headers: [\"Method\", \"0.5B\", \"1.5B\", \"3B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"RRF 4-signal\", 0.962, 0.924, 0.943]\n          - [\"S1 only\", 0.979, 0.972, 0.964]\n          - [\"S2 only\", 0.465, 0.740, 0.819]\n          - [\"S3 only\", 0.533, 0.814, 0.855]\n          - [\"S4 only\", 0.481, 0.712, 0.773]\n          - [\"RRF 2-signal (closed)\", 0.508, 0.782, 0.831]\n          - [\"Equal-weight rank avg\", \"—\", 0.908, \"—\"]\n          - [\"Calibrated weighted RRF\", \"—\", 0.931, \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"RRF signal contribution 分析图：stacked bar chart 展示各信号在 RRF composite 中的贡献比例，0.5B 几乎全为 S1，1.5B/3B 呈均匀分布。\"\n    analysis: >\n      RRF 在 0.5B 退化为 S1-dominated（weight share 89%）是预期的、正确的行为。\n      论文应 honestly 报告这一 degradation 并强调：(1) RRF 的价值在 1.5B+ 显现，\n      实现真正多信号融合; (2) 即使在 0.5B，RRF 的 graceful degradation 优于\n      hard failure; (3) FP robustness 证明 RRF 是比 learned aggregation 更稳健\n      的选择（meta-circularity argument 成立）。calibrated weighted RRF 微弱优势\n      不足以 justify 引入 training 依赖。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-004 v2: Simulation Identifiability Sweep (completion)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"simulation_identifiability_sweep_v2\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: >\n      完成 120-condition simulation sweep。已有 48/120 条完成\n      （AUC=0.55 全部完成，AUC=0.80 部分）。预测全部完成后的结果。\n    expected_results:\n      # AUC=0.55 (已有数据的延伸)\n      auc055_n20_gamma_bias: 0.020\n      auc055_n20_gamma_rmse: 0.040\n      auc055_n20_ci95_width_pp: 13.3\n      auc055_n20_ci95_coverage: 0.80\n      auc055_n50_gamma_bias: 0.015\n      auc055_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.026\n      auc055_n50_ci95_width_pp: 8.7\n      auc055_n50_ci95_coverage: 0.90\n      auc055_n100_gamma_bias: -0.003\n      auc055_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.004\n      auc055_n100_ci95_width_pp: 6.5\n      auc055_n100_ci95_coverage: 1.0\n      # AUC=0.65 (预测)\n      auc065_n20_gamma_bias: 0.016\n      auc065_n20_gamma_rmse: 0.035\n      auc065_n20_ci95_width_pp: 11.8\n      auc065_n20_ci95_coverage: 0.85\n      auc065_n50_gamma_bias: 0.010\n      auc065_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.020\n      auc065_n50_ci95_width_pp: 7.6\n      auc065_n50_ci95_coverage: 0.93\n      auc065_n100_gamma_bias: -0.004\n      auc065_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.008\n      auc065_n100_ci95_width_pp: 5.8\n      auc065_n100_ci95_coverage: 0.97\n      # AUC=0.70 (关键阈值)\n      auc070_n50_gamma_bias: 0.008\n      auc070_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.018\n      auc070_n50_ci95_width_pp: 7.0\n      auc070_n50_ci95_coverage: 0.95\n      auc070_n100_gamma_bias: -0.002\n      auc070_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.006\n      auc070_n100_ci95_width_pp: 5.3\n      auc070_n100_ci95_coverage: 0.98\n      # AUC=0.80 (更多 seeds 确认)\n      auc080_n50_gamma_bias: 0.006\n      auc080_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.014\n      auc080_n50_ci95_width_pp: 6.2\n      auc080_n50_ci95_coverage: 0.96\n      auc080_n100_gamma_bias: 0.003\n      auc080_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.005\n      auc080_n100_ci95_width_pp: 4.8\n      auc080_n100_ci95_coverage: 0.98\n      # AUC=0.90\n      auc090_n50_gamma_bias: 0.004\n      auc090_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.010\n      auc090_n50_ci95_width_pp: 5.4\n      auc090_n50_ci95_coverage: 0.97\n      auc090_n100_gamma_bias: 0.002\n      auc090_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.004\n      auc090_n100_ci95_width_pp: 4.2\n      auc090_n100_ci95_coverage: 0.99\n      # Prior sensitivity\n      prior_sd05_ci_narrowing_pct: 18\n      prior_sd20_ci_widening_pct: 28\n      # Continuous exposure\n      continuous_vs_binary_ci_ratio: 0.92\n      # Fisher Information key result\n      fisher_info_auc_threshold_structural: 0.52\n      fisher_info_auc_threshold_practical: 0.70\n      # Growing Pains at N=20\n      growing_pains_n20_ci_narrowing_pct: 22\n      # MCMC quality\n      total_divergences: 0\n      max_rhat_across_all: 1.012\n      median_fit_time_sec: 1150\n    result_rationale: >\n      AUC=0.80 N=50 的 CI width (6.2pp) 相比初步 1-seed 的 16.2pp 大幅下降——\n      初始异常值被 seed 平均消除（1-seed 结果是极端离群值，10-seed 平均\n      回归到与趋势一致的水平）。CI width 随 AUC 单调递减（从 0.55 的 8.7pp\n      到 0.90 的 5.4pp at N=50）符合 Fisher Information 预测：I(γ) 随 AUC\n      增大，posterior uncertainty 随之收缩。CI width 随 N 按 ~1/√N 缩放\n      （实测比率 N20/N100 = 2.04 at AUC=0.55，理论 2.24）。\n      coverage 在 N=20 时低于 nominal (80-85%) 因为少量 examinee 导致\n      posterior 过于集中——这是已知的 small-N IRT limitation。N≥50 时\n      coverage 达 90%+，N=100 时接近 nominal。Fisher Information 推导\n      给出 structural identifiability 下界 AUC≈0.52（I(γ)>0 的理论保证），\n      practical threshold AUC≈0.70 定义为 \"CI95 width < 10pp at N=50\"。\n      连续 exposure 比 binary 产生 ~8% 更窄的 CI，因为连续值提供更多\n      信息。Growing Pains pre-estimation 在 N=20 缩窄 CI ~22%，因为\n      借用外部数据的 item parameter 估计减少了参数不确定性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"γ Recovery: AUC × N_models Grid (γ_true=0.5)\"\n        headers: [\"AUC\", \"N\", \"Bias\", \"RMSE\", \"CI95 Width (pp)\", \"Coverage 95%\", \"θ Corr\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.55, 20, \"+0.020\", 0.040, 13.3, \"80%\", 0.958]\n          - [0.55, 50, \"+0.015\", 0.026, 8.7, \"90%\", 0.947]\n          - [0.55, 100, \"−0.003\", 0.004, 6.5, \"100%\", 0.950]\n          - [0.65, 20, \"+0.016\", 0.035, 11.8, \"85%\", 0.955]\n          - [0.65, 50, \"+0.010\", 0.020, 7.6, \"93%\", 0.952]\n          - [0.65, 100, \"−0.004\", 0.008, 5.8, \"97%\", 0.956]\n          - [0.70, 50, \"+0.008\", 0.018, 7.0, \"95%\", 0.958]\n          - [0.70, 100, \"−0.002\", 0.006, 5.3, \"98%\", 0.961]\n          - [0.80, 50, \"+0.006\", 0.014, 6.2, \"96%\", 0.960]\n          - [0.80, 100, \"+0.003\", 0.005, 4.8, \"98%\", 0.965]\n          - [0.90, 50, \"+0.004\", 0.010, 5.4, \"97%\", 0.964]\n          - [0.90, 100, \"+0.002\", 0.004, 4.2, \"99%\", 0.968]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Identifiability phase diagram: x=AUC, y=N_models, 颜色=CI95 width。10pp 等高线标注 practical boundary。\"\n      - \"Fisher Information I(γ) vs AUC 理论曲线叠加 empirical CI width，验证解析预测与模拟一致。\"\n    analysis: >\n      AUC≥0.70 at N≥50 为 practical identifiability sweet spot（CI<7pp,\n      coverage≥95%）。这正好对应 best tier 的 S2 AUC at 1.5B (~0.74)，\n      意味着 1.5B 模型的 Min-K++ 信号刚好越过 practical threshold。\n      AUC=0.55 仍可识别（CI<9pp at N≥50）但 coverage 仅 90%——需要\n      measurement error model 补偿。Fisher Information 推导提供理论根基，\n      解决 reviewer concern #1。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-005 v3: Noise Propagation & Measurement Error Model\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"noise_propagation_analysis_v3\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      测量误差模型将 Stage 1 信号不确定性传播至 IRT posterior。当前 v3\n      在 σ_e=0.1 条件下 ME 与 simple 模型差异不显著（γ 偏差问题待修复）。\n      Best tier 预测在更高 σ_e 条件下 ME 模型展现明确优势。\n    expected_results:\n      # σ_e=0.1 (低噪声，已有数据修正后)\n      sigma01_me_gamma_bias: 0.02\n      sigma01_me_gamma_rmse: 0.04\n      sigma01_me_ci95_coverage: 0.95\n      sigma01_me_ci_width_pp: 5.2\n      sigma01_simple_gamma_bias: 0.03\n      sigma01_simple_ci95_coverage: 0.91\n      sigma01_simple_ci_width_pp: 4.8\n      # σ_e=0.3 (中等噪声，ME 优势显现)\n      sigma03_me_gamma_bias: 0.04\n      sigma03_me_gamma_rmse: 0.07\n      sigma03_me_ci95_coverage: 0.93\n      sigma03_me_ci_width_pp: 7.8\n      sigma03_simple_gamma_bias: 0.09\n      sigma03_simple_ci95_coverage: 0.78\n      sigma03_simple_ci_width_pp: 5.1\n      # σ_e=0.5 (高噪声)\n      sigma05_me_gamma_bias: 0.06\n      sigma05_me_gamma_rmse: 0.11\n      sigma05_me_ci95_coverage: 0.91\n      sigma05_me_ci_width_pp: 11.4\n      sigma05_simple_gamma_bias: 0.18\n      sigma05_simple_ci95_coverage: 0.65\n      sigma05_simple_ci_width_pp: 5.3\n      # Post-hoc noise injection (Part B)\n      noise_1x_ci_widening_pct: 28\n      noise_15x_ci_widening_pct: 52\n      noise_2x_ci_widening_pct: 83\n      # Coverage gap closure\n      coverage_gap_simple_vs_nominal: 0.13\n      coverage_gap_me_vs_nominal: 0.01\n    result_rationale: >\n      当前 v3 结果中 γ 偏差问题（seed 42: 0.793 vs true 0.5, seed 43: 0.402）\n      源于模型中 latent τ prior 与真实 exposure 分布不匹配——在 best tier，\n      这通过 prior calibration (使用 exp-001 ground-truth FP/FN rates 估计\n      σ_e) 和增加 seeds (20+ seeds 平均) 得到解决。σ_e=0.1 时 ME vs simple\n      差异小（覆盖 95% vs 91%），因为低噪声下 point-estimate exposure\n      已足够好。σ_e=0.3 时差异显著（93% vs 78%），因为 simple 模型将噪声\n      错误归因为真实 exposure variation，导致 γ 被高估且 CI 过窄。ME 模型\n      通过显式建模 noise 产生更宽但更诚实的 CI。σ_e=0.5 时 ME 覆盖仍有\n      91%（略低于 nominal），因为高噪声下即使 ME 模型也难以完全分离\n      signal 和 noise。simple 模型在 σ_e=0.5 时严重失效（65% coverage）。\n      Post-hoc noise injection的 CI widening 与 σ_e 水平呈超线性关系。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"ME vs Simple Model Coverage (95% nominal)\"\n        headers: [\"σ_e\", \"ME Coverage\", \"ME CI Width (pp)\", \"Simple Coverage\", \"Simple CI Width (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.1, \"95%\", 5.2, \"91%\", 4.8]\n          - [0.3, \"93%\", 7.8, \"78%\", 5.1]\n          - [0.5, \"91%\", 11.4, \"65%\", 5.3]\n      - name: \"Post-hoc Noise Injection CI Widening\"\n        headers: [\"Noise Level\", \"γ CI Widening\", \"θ CI Widening\", \"Coverage Change\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1.0×\", \"+28%\", \"+15%\", \"−3pp\"]\n          - [\"1.5×\", \"+52%\", \"+31%\", \"−8pp\"]\n          - [\"2.0×\", \"+83%\", \"+48%\", \"−15pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Coverage vs σ_e 双线图：ME model 维持在 nominal 附近，simple model 随 σ_e 增大快速下降。\"\n    analysis: >\n      ME 模型是 C3 claims 的关键基础设施。在真实场景中 σ_e ≈ 0.15-0.30\n      （基于 exp-002 signal pipeline 的 FP/FN rates），ME 模型将 coverage\n      从 ~78-91% 提升至 93-95%。这解决了 exp-004 simulation sweep 中\n      发现的 coverage gap（尤其在 low-AUC/small-N regime）。CI width\n      增加是必要代价——更宽的 CI 反映了 genuine epistemic uncertainty。\n      论文中框架为：\"Models with high-AUC signals get tighter CIs;\n      those with degraded signals get appropriately wider CIs.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-006: IRT Calibration & Baselines (Headline Experiment)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"irt_calibration_and_baselines\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      核心实验。4PL+γ IRT per-benchmark fitting on 3 scales × 5 dosages ×\n      3 seeds = 45 model instances per benchmark。与 7 baselines 对比\n      5 metrics。best tier: 全面优于所有 baselines。\n    expected_results:\n      # ===== Aggregate metrics (across 3 benchmarks, 3 scales, 4 dosages) =====\n      # Ours: 4PL+γ with ME model\n      ours_mae_pp: 1.8\n      ours_mae_bootstrap_lo: 1.2\n      ours_mae_bootstrap_hi: 2.4\n      ours_ci95_coverage: 0.94\n      ours_ci80_coverage: 0.83\n      ours_ci50_coverage: 0.52\n      ours_ci_width_avg_pp: 4.2\n      ours_kendall_tau: 0.96\n      ours_dose_response_monotonicity: 0.95\n      # Baseline 0: Raw (no adjustment)\n      b0_raw_mae_pp: 8.2\n      b0_raw_kendall_tau: 0.87\n      # Baseline 1: Remove-and-rescore\n      b1_remove_mae_pp: 4.6\n      b1_remove_kendall_tau: 0.91\n      # Baseline 2: Single-signal 2PL+γ (best signal = S1)\n      b2_single_2pl_mae_pp: 2.9\n      b2_single_2pl_ci95_coverage: 0.81\n      b2_single_2pl_ci_width_pp: 5.6\n      b2_single_2pl_kendall_tau: 0.94\n      # Baseline 3: Vanilla 4PL (no γ)\n      b3_vanilla_4pl_mae_pp: 6.5\n      b3_vanilla_4pl_ci95_coverage: 0.58\n      b3_vanilla_4pl_ci_width_pp: 3.2\n      b3_vanilla_4pl_kendall_tau: 0.89\n      # Baseline 4: Linear exposure regression + bootstrap CI\n      b4_linear_mae_pp: 3.2\n      b4_linear_ci95_coverage: 0.76\n      b4_linear_ci_width_pp: 6.8\n      b4_linear_kendall_tau: 0.93\n      # Baseline 5: Emperor's mitigation (rephrase + shuffle)\n      b5_emperor_mae_pp: 5.8\n      b5_emperor_kendall_tau: 0.89\n      # Baseline 6: DCR fuzzy (EMNLP 2025)\n      b6_dcr_mae_pp: 3.9\n      b6_dcr_kendall_tau: 0.92\n      # ===== Per-benchmark breakdown =====\n      # MMLU\n      ours_mmlu_mae_pp: 1.1\n      b0_raw_mmlu_mae_pp: 4.3\n      b6_dcr_mmlu_mae_pp: 2.5\n      # GSM8K (most challenging due to 3B 57pp inflation)\n      ours_gsm8k_mae_pp: 2.8\n      b0_raw_gsm8k_mae_pp: 14.6\n      b6_dcr_gsm8k_mae_pp: 6.2\n      # ARC-Challenge\n      ours_arc_mae_pp: 1.2\n      b0_raw_arc_mae_pp: 4.8\n      b6_dcr_arc_mae_pp: 2.8\n      # ===== Per-scale breakdown (our method) =====\n      ours_05B_mae_pp: 2.3\n      ours_15B_mae_pp: 1.4\n      ours_3B_mae_pp: 1.6\n      # ===== IRT parameter estimates =====\n      # Per-benchmark γ_k\n      gamma_mmlu_mean: 0.22\n      gamma_mmlu_ci: [0.08, 0.38]\n      gamma_gsm8k_mean: 0.85\n      gamma_gsm8k_ci: [0.62, 1.12]\n      gamma_arc_mean: 0.18\n      gamma_arc_ci: [0.04, 0.34]\n      # γ heterogeneity across benchmarks (supports per-benchmark fitting)\n      gamma_heterogeneity_chi2_p: 0.002\n      # Joint model ablation (shared global γ)\n      joint_gamma_global: 0.41\n      joint_gamma_mae_pp: 2.6\n      # Posterior predictive check (local independence)\n      residual_correlation_mean: 0.032\n      residual_correlation_max: 0.085\n      # MCMC diagnostics\n      mcmc_divergences: 0\n      mcmc_max_rhat: 1.008\n      mcmc_min_ess: 850\n      mcmc_fit_time_per_benchmark_min: 45\n    result_rationale: >\n      MAE 1.8pp (CI [1.2, 2.4]) 的分解：\n      MMLU (1.1pp) 最低因为污染效应小（0.5B 的 forgetting 被 θ 下降吸收，\n      1.5B/3B 的 inflation 仅 0.5-1.8pp 容易矫正）。\n      GSM8K (2.8pp) 最高因为 3B 的 57pp inflation 要求巨大矫正——即使 IRT\n      模型准确估计 γ=0.85，exposure-score 中的噪声在乘以 γ 后放大为\n      ~3pp residual。ARC (1.2pp) 居中。\n      0.5B MAE (2.3pp) 高于 1.5B/3B 因为：(1) 0.5B 信号质量差（仅 S1\n      有效，exposure 估计噪声大）；(2) catastrophic forgetting 使 θ 和 γ\n      效应交织。ME 模型在 0.5B 条件下产生更宽 CI 以补偿。\n      γ_k heterogeneity (p=0.002) 证明 per-benchmark fitting 优于\n      joint fitting——GSM8K 的 γ=0.85 远高于 MMLU/ARC 的 0.18-0.22，\n      反映 MC 格式对 memorization 的易感性差异。\n      joint model (shared γ=0.41) MAE 2.6pp > per-benchmark 1.8pp,\n      确认 heterogeneity matters。\n      Baselines 排序：DCR (3.9) > Linear (3.2) > Single-2PL+γ (2.9) > ours (1.8)。\n      DCR 的 6.2pp GSM8K MAE 暴露了它对 large inflation 的处理弱点。\n      Vanilla 4PL (6.5pp) 接近 Raw (8.2pp) 因为没有 contamination modeling\n      的 IRT 将 inflation 错误吸收进 θ。Emperor (5.8pp) 确认 mitigation\n      策略不足以消除 contamination effect。\n      Coverage 0.94 接近 nominal 0.95（ME model 功劳），而 Simple model\n      (B2, B3) 覆盖仅 58-81%——vanilla 4PL 的 58% 说明不建模 contamination\n      的 IRT 产出过窄、错误的 CI。\n      Kendall τ=0.96 说明 calibrated ranking 高度保真。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Main Results: 8 Methods × 5 Metrics\"\n        headers: [\"Method\", \"MAE (pp)↓\", \"95% Coverage↑\", \"CI Width (pp)↓\", \"Kendall τ↑\", \"Monotonicity\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"4PL+γ ME (ours)\", \"1.8 [1.2,2.4]\", \"94%\", 4.2, 0.96, 0.95]\n          - [\"B0: Raw\", 8.2, \"—\", \"—\", 0.87, \"—\"]\n          - [\"B1: Remove-rescore\", 4.6, \"—\", \"—\", 0.91, \"—\"]\n          - [\"B2: 2PL+γ (S1 only)\", 2.9, \"81%\", 5.6, 0.94, 0.90]\n          - [\"B3: Vanilla 4PL\", 6.5, \"58%\", 3.2, 0.89, \"—\"]\n          - [\"B4: Linear reg + boot\", 3.2, \"76%\", 6.8, 0.93, 0.85]\n          - [\"B5: Emperor mitigation\", 5.8, \"—\", \"—\", 0.89, \"—\"]\n          - [\"B6: DCR fuzzy\", 3.9, \"—\", \"—\", 0.92, 0.80]\n      - name: \"Per-Benchmark MAE (pp): Our Method vs Key Baselines\"\n        headers: [\"Benchmark\", \"4PL+γ ME\", \"B0 Raw\", \"B2 2PL+γ\", \"B4 Linear\", \"B6 DCR\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", 1.1, 4.3, 1.8, 2.1, 2.5]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", 2.8, 14.6, 4.2, 5.1, 6.2]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", 1.2, 4.8, 2.0, 2.2, 2.8]\n          - [\"Average\", 1.8, 8.2, 2.9, 3.2, 3.9]\n      - name: \"Per-Benchmark γ_k Estimates\"\n        headers: [\"Benchmark\", \"γ_k mean\", \"95% CI\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", 0.22, \"[0.08, 0.38]\", \"MC memorization 产生中等 inflation\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", 0.85, \"[0.62, 1.12]\", \"生成式任务极易被 answer memorization 加速\"]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", 0.18, \"[0.04, 0.34]\", \"MC 格式但 science reasoning 部分抗 memorization\"]\n      - name: \"Dose-Response: 3B GSM8K (最戏剧性案例)\"\n        headers: [\"Dosage\", \"Observed\", \"Calibrated (ours)\", \"True (d000)\", \"Residual\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"d000 (0%)\", \"12.0%\", \"—\", \"12.0%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"d005 (5%)\", \"20.8%\", \"13.2%\", \"12.0%\", \"+1.2pp\"]\n          - [\"d025 (25%)\", \"~35.4%\", \"14.5%\", \"12.0%\", \"+2.5pp\"]\n          - [\"d050 (50%)\", \"~51.8%\", \"15.1%\", \"12.0%\", \"+3.1pp\"]\n          - [\"d100 (100%)\", \"69.7%\", \"16.2%\", \"12.0%\", \"+4.2pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Calibrated-vs-true scatter plot with CIs: 每个点是一个 (model, benchmark) pair，x=true score, y=calibrated score。4PL+γ 点紧贴对角线，CI bars 覆盖真值。baselines 散布更广。\"\n      - \"Dose-response 曲线 (3B GSM8K): x=dosage, y=accuracy。三条线：observed (陡增), raw baseline (同 observed), calibrated (近水平)。CI band 覆盖 true score。\"\n      - \"Per-benchmark γ_k posterior density plot: MMLU/ARC 集中在 0.2 附近，GSM8K 在 0.85——直观展示 benchmark heterogeneity。\"\n      - \"Reliability diagram: calibrated probability vs empirical accuracy, 对比 ours vs B3 vanilla 4PL。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的 Table 1。核心叙事：(1) ContamCal MAE 1.8pp 显著优于最佳\n      baseline DCR 的 3.9pp (bootstrap p<0.01)；(2) 唯一提供 near-nominal\n      coverage 的方法（94% vs baselines 的 58-81%）；(3) γ_k heterogeneity\n      证明 per-benchmark fitting 的必要性——GSM8K γ=0.85 vs MMLU γ=0.22\n      差异 4 倍，joint model 会 overfit MMLU 同时 underfit GSM8K；\n      (4) 3B GSM8K dose-response 是最佳可视化案例（57pp inflation 被矫正\n      至 ~4pp residual）。0.5B 的 higher MAE (2.3pp) 和 wider CI 不是缺陷\n      而是 honest UQ——信号差的模型得到更宽的 CI，这恰好是 C3 的核心主张。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-007: 7B Scale Bridging\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"scale_bridging_7b\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B LoRA SFT at 5 dosage levels (d000-d100)。验证\n      calibration 在更大模型上成立。需 multi-GPU (1×H100 per run)。\n    expected_results:\n      # 7B baseline scores (d000)\n      d000_mmlu: 0.718\n      d000_gsm8k: 0.792\n      d000_arc: 0.878\n      d000_humaneval: 0.415\n      # Contamination inflation\n      d005_mmlu_inflation_pp: 0.8\n      d005_gsm8k_inflation_pp: 1.2\n      d025_mmlu_inflation_pp: 2.5\n      d025_gsm8k_inflation_pp: 5.8\n      d100_mmlu_inflation_pp: 4.1\n      d100_gsm8k_inflation_pp: 12.5\n      d100_arc_inflation_pp: 2.8\n      # Signal quality at 7B\n      S1_d005_auc_7B_mean: 0.954\n      S2_d005_auc_7B_mean: 0.871\n      S4_d005_auc_7B_mean: 0.812\n      # Calibration\n      calibration_mae_pp_7B: 1.4\n      ci95_coverage_7B: 0.95\n      kendall_tau_7B: 0.97\n    result_rationale: >\n      7B 有更强的 memorization capacity，contamination inflation 比 3B\n      更显著但更均匀（不像 3B 的 GSM8K 极端案例，因为 7B baseline GSM8K\n      已经 79.2%，天花板效应限制了 inflation 幅度）。MMLU inflation\n      从 3B 的 0.8pp 升至 4.1pp 因为 7B 有更好的 knowledge retrieval\n      能力，memorized items 的 boost 更 pronounced。信号质量在 7B 进一步\n      提升（S2 AUC 0.87, S4 AUC 0.81），验证了 scale-dependent trend\n      的外推。calibration MAE 1.4pp (低于 0.5B-3B 的 1.8pp aggregate)\n      因为 7B 信号质量更好 → exposure 估计更准 → γ 矫正更精确。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"7B Dose-Response\"\n        headers: [\"Dosage\", \"MMLU\", \"GSM8K\", \"ARC-C\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"d000\", \"71.8%\", \"79.2%\", \"87.8%\"]\n          - [\"d005\", \"72.6%\", \"80.4%\", \"88.1%\"]\n          - [\"d025\", \"74.3%\", \"85.0%\", \"89.2%\"]\n          - [\"d100\", \"75.9%\", \"91.7%\", \"90.6%\"]\n      - name: \"7B Signal AUC at d005\"\n        headers: [\"Signal\", \"MMLU\", \"GSM8K\", \"ARC-C\", \"Mean\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"S1 Embedding\", 0.948, 0.971, 0.943, 0.954]\n          - [\"S2 Min-K++\", 0.851, 0.896, 0.865, 0.871]\n          - [\"S3 ConStat\", 0.872, 0.908, 0.881, 0.887]\n          - [\"S4 Self-Critique\", 0.795, 0.834, 0.808, 0.812]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scale-vs-MAE 趋势图: x=model scale (0.5B→7B), y=calibration MAE。展示 MAE 随 scale 下降的趋势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B 结果确认 calibration 可靠性随 scale 提升（MAE 1.4pp < aggregate\n      1.8pp）。信号质量持续改善支持 \"larger models are easier to calibrate\"\n      叙事。7B 作为 controlled experiment 的上界，为 Reviewer Concern #4\n      (scale limited to 3B) 提供直接回应。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-008: Signal Survival Analysis (multi-scale extension)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"signal_survival_multiscale\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      将 exp-008 从 0.5B-only 扩展至 1.5B/3B。这是 C2 \"scale-dependent\"\n      claim 的核心证据。heatmap 图从 1 列扩展为 3 列。\n    expected_results:\n      # Cross-scale signal effectiveness summary\n      effective_signals_05B: 1\n      effective_signals_15B: 3\n      effective_signals_3B: 4\n      # S2 Min-K++ AUC trajectory across scales (d005, benchmark-averaged)\n      S2_auc_trajectory: [0.465, 0.740, 0.819]\n      S2_scale_labels: [\"0.5B\", \"1.5B\", \"3B\"]\n      # S4 Self-Critique trajectory\n      S4_auc_trajectory: [0.481, 0.712, 0.773]\n      # Min-K++ reversal Cohen's d trajectory (d100)\n      S2_reversal_cohens_d_trajectory: [-1.98, -1.52, -1.14]\n      # S1 stability\n      S1_auc_trajectory: [0.979, 0.979, 0.974]\n      # Scale-dependent threshold crossing\n      S2_crosses_070_at_scale: \"1.5B\"\n      S4_crosses_070_at_scale: \"1.5B\"\n      S4_crosses_065_at_scale: \"1.5B\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      S2 从 0.47 (0.5B) → 0.74 (1.5B) → 0.82 (3B) 呈 log-scale 近线性增长，\n      与 memorization capacity 的 scaling 一致。S4 从 0.48 → 0.71 → 0.77，\n      增速略慢因为 Self-Critique 依赖生成质量（不如 token-level 信号对\n      scale 敏感）。S1 跨尺度稳定在 0.97+ 因为 embedding similarity 是\n      training-data-independent 信号。Min-K++ 反转在 1.5B/3B 持续但减弱：\n      1.5B 的 -1.52 和 3B 的 -1.14 vs 0.5B 的 -1.98，因为更大模型的\n      perplexity 分布更稳定，d100 全量污染的 distribution shift 相对更小。\n      0.5B→1.5B 的跃变最大（effective signals 从 1 跳到 3），说明\n      1.5B 是 signal effectiveness 的关键转折点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Signal × Scale Effectiveness Summary\"\n        headers: [\"Signal\", \"0.5B d005 AUC\", \"1.5B d005 AUC\", \"3B d005 AUC\", \"Status\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"S1 Embedding\", 0.979, 0.979, 0.974, \"Robust across scales\"]\n          - [\"S2 Min-K++\", 0.465, 0.740, 0.819, \"Recovers at 1.5B+ (crosses 0.70)\"]\n          - [\"S3 ConStat\", \"~0.53\", 0.814, 0.855, \"Recovers at 1.5B+\"]\n          - [\"S4 Self-Critique\", 0.481, 0.712, 0.773, \"Recovers at 1.5B+ (crosses 0.70)\"]\n      - name: \"Min-K++ Directional Reversal (d100 Cross-Model Cohen's d)\"\n        headers: [\"Benchmark\", \"0.5B\", \"1.5B\", \"3B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", -1.22, -1.08, -0.85]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", -2.67, -1.78, -1.31]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", -2.05, -1.71, -1.26]\n          - [\"Mean\", -1.98, -1.52, -1.14]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Signal × Scale × Dosage AUC heatmap: Fig.2 of paper。3×4 grid (3 scales × 4 signals)，每格颜色=d005 AUC。0.5B 行仅 S1 为暖色，1.5B/3B 行逐渐变暖。\"\n      - \"Scale-dependent AUC trajectory: line plot, x=scale, y=AUC, 4 lines for 4 signals。S1 水平线，S2/S3/S4 上升曲线，0.70 threshold 虚线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的 Fig.2 和 C2 的核心证据。scale-dependent signal effectiveness\n      在 1.5B crossing point 得到实证验证。Min-K++ 从 \"fails at small scale\"\n      到 \"recovers at larger scale\" 的转变为整个 C2 narrative 提供了\n      convincing evidence。Min-K++ reversal 的 scale attenuation (-1.98 →\n      -1.52 → -1.14) 是 nuanced finding：reversal 在所有尺度持续存在，\n      但严重性降低。论文中框架为 \"Min-K++ should be used with extreme\n      caution at any scale under high contamination dosage.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-009: RL Observational Case Study\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"rl_observational_case_study\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-Instruct (0.5B-7B) 和 DeepSeek-R1-Distill (1.5B/7B)\n      上应用 ContamCal。无 ground truth (observational)，重点是\n      directional external validity。\n    expected_results:\n      # Signal quality on Instruct/RL models\n      S1_auc_instruct_05B: 0.91\n      S1_auc_instruct_15B: 0.93\n      S1_auc_instruct_3B: 0.94\n      S1_auc_instruct_7B: 0.95\n      S2_auc_instruct_15B: 0.62\n      S2_auc_instruct_3B: 0.71\n      # γ estimates on Instruct models\n      gamma_mmlu_instruct: 0.15\n      gamma_mmlu_instruct_ci: [0.02, 0.31]\n      gamma_gsm8k_instruct: 0.42\n      gamma_gsm8k_instruct_ci: [0.18, 0.68]\n      # DeepSeek-R1\n      gamma_mmlu_deepseek: 0.08\n      gamma_mmlu_deepseek_ci: [-0.06, 0.24]\n      # CI widths (should be wider than controlled experiments)\n      ci_width_instruct_avg_pp: 6.8\n      ci_width_deepseek_avg_pp: 8.2\n      # Expected regret: top-5 model selection\n      regret_uncalibrated_rank_changes: 3\n      regret_calibrated_rank_changes: 1\n      # Near-zero γ check (specificity)\n      gamma_known_clean_benchmark: 0.02\n      gamma_known_clean_ci_includes_zero: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Instruct 模型的信号质量低于 controlled SFT 因为 RLHF/DPO post-training\n      扰动了 token-level 统计特征。S1 仍有效但 AUC 略降（0.91-0.95 vs\n      controlled 的 0.95-0.99），S2 在 Instruct 上更难恢复（1.5B 仅 0.62，\n      低于 controlled 的 0.74）因为 RL 进一步模糊了 memorization 信号。\n      γ estimates 对 Instruct 模型较低（MMLU 0.15 vs controlled 0.22）\n      说明 Instruct fine-tuning 部分缓解了 contamination inflation（或者\n      instruction-following 改变了 response 策略）。GSM8K γ 仍较高（0.42）\n      因为 math reasoning 的 contamination 更难被 RL 消除。DeepSeek-R1\n      的 γ CI 包含 0（MMLU: [-0.06, 0.24]），consistent with 可能的低\n      contamination 或 reasoning-focused training 的 decontamination 效果。\n      CI width 更宽（6.8-8.2pp vs controlled 4.2pp）是 honest UQ 的体现。\n      Near-zero γ on clean benchmark (0.02, CI includes 0) 验证 specificity。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RL Observational: Calibrated vs Uncalibrated Ranking\"\n        headers: [\"Model\", \"Uncalib MMLU\", \"Calib MMLU\", \"95% CI\", \"Rank Change\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\", \"47.2%\", \"46.8%\", \"[43.1, 50.5]\", 0]\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\", \"61.5%\", \"60.2%\", \"[56.8, 63.6]\", 0]\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\", \"68.3%\", \"67.1%\", \"[63.5, 70.7]\", 0]\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\", \"74.8%\", \"73.2%\", \"[70.1, 76.3]\", -1]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-R1-1.5B\", \"58.9%\", \"58.4%\", \"[53.8, 63.0]\", +1]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-R1-7B\", \"75.2%\", \"74.6%\", \"[71.0, 78.2]\", 0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Calibrated ranking comparison: paired bar chart showing uncalibrated vs calibrated MMLU scores with CI error bars。排名变化标注。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Observational study 提供 directional external validity。关键发现：\n      (1) Instruct 模型 CI 更宽反映信号质量退化——honest UQ 在 action；\n      (2) GSM8K contamination 在 Instruct 后仍存在（γ=0.42），说明\n      RLHF 未完全消除 memorization；(3) specificity check pass 排除\n      false positive contamination detection；(4) ranking changes 较少\n      (1 out of 6) 说明 calibration 的 ranking impact 是 marginal 但\n      CI widths 差异很大——即使排名不变，uncertainty awareness 也有价值。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-012: 72B Observational\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"observational_72b\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-012\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B inference-only observational分析。验证信号和\n      calibration 在 frontier 模型规模下是否成立。无 SFT，仅推理。\n    expected_results:\n      # 72B baseline scores\n      baseline_mmlu: 0.854\n      baseline_gsm8k: 0.908\n      baseline_arc: 0.943\n      # Signal quality\n      S1_auc_72B: 0.96\n      S2_auc_72B: 0.89\n      S3_auc_72B: 0.91\n      S4_auc_72B: 0.84\n      # γ estimates\n      gamma_mmlu_72B: 0.12\n      gamma_mmlu_72B_ci: [-0.02, 0.28]\n      gamma_gsm8k_72B: 0.18\n      gamma_gsm8k_72B_ci: [0.01, 0.37]\n      # Calibrated scores\n      calibrated_mmlu: 0.842\n      calibrated_gsm8k: 0.893\n      ci_width_avg_pp: 5.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      72B 作为 single observational model（无 contamination variation），\n      γ 估计依赖于 exposure score variation across items（不同 items\n      有不同 exposure levels）。γ CI 较宽因为 single model 提供的\n      information 有限。MMLU γ CI 包含 0，consistent with 72B 在\n      MMLU 上可能 contamination 较低（或 frontier model 的 knowledge\n      已经足够高，contamination boost 可忽略）。GSM8K γ 显著大于 0\n      (CI: [0.01, 0.37])，提示即使在 72B，math reasoning benchmarks\n      仍存在 contamination concern。信号质量在 72B 是最高的（S2 0.89,\n      S4 0.84），确认 scale-dependent trend 的外推。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"72B Observational Results\"\n        headers: [\"Benchmark\", \"Raw Score\", \"Calibrated\", \"95% CI\", \"γ_k\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"85.4%\", \"84.2%\", \"[81.5, 86.9]\", \"0.12 [-0.02, 0.28]\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"90.8%\", \"89.3%\", \"[86.2, 92.4]\", \"0.18 [0.01, 0.37]\"]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", \"94.3%\", \"93.8%\", \"[91.4, 96.2]\", \"0.09 [-0.04, 0.23]\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"72B 作为 ecological validity extension 呈现在 Appendix。bar chart: raw vs calibrated with CI。\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B 结果展示 ContamCal 在 frontier scale 的适用性。calibration 调整\n      幅度小（1-1.5pp）但统计上 GSM8K 的 γ 显著不为零，说明即使\n      frontier 模型也存在可检测的 contamination signal。Signal quality\n      达到最高水平 (S2 AUC 0.89) 进一步支持 scale-dependent narrative。\n      Limitation: single model, γ estimates noisy.\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-013: Closed-Weight 2-Signal Mode\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"closed_weight_2signal_mode\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-013\"\n    description: >\n      仅 ConStat + Self-Critique (无 logits/embeddings) 的退化模式。\n      量化 2-signal vs 4-signal calibration gap。\n    expected_results:\n      # 2-signal RRF AUC (closed-weight mode)\n      rrf_2signal_auc_05B: 0.508\n      rrf_2signal_auc_15B: 0.782\n      rrf_2signal_auc_3B: 0.831\n      # Calibration with 2-signal\n      mae_2signal_05B_pp: 6.8\n      mae_2signal_15B_pp: 2.8\n      mae_2signal_3B_pp: 2.1\n      mae_2signal_avg_pp: 3.9\n      ci95_coverage_2signal: 0.86\n      # Gap vs 4-signal\n      mae_gap_4signal_vs_2signal_pp: 2.1\n      coverage_gap: 0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      0.5B 2-signal 近似失效 (AUC 0.508) 因为 S3/S4 在 0.5B 都不工作，\n      MAE 6.8pp 接近 raw baseline。1.5B 2-signal MAE 2.8pp 可用但明显\n      劣于 4-signal 的 1.4pp——信息损失约 1.4pp。3B 2-signal MAE 2.1pp\n      已较接近 4-signal 的 1.6pp（gap 仅 0.5pp），因为 S3+S4 在 3B\n      已较强 (AUC 0.83+)。Coverage 86% 低于 4-signal 的 94% 因为\n      exposure 估计噪声更大但 ME model 补偿不足。整体 2-signal 平均\n      MAE 3.9pp 与 DCR baseline 的 3.9pp 持平——说明 even in degraded\n      mode, ContamCal matches the best existing method, while providing CIs.\n    tables:\n      - name: \"4-Signal vs 2-Signal (Closed-Weight) Comparison\"\n        headers: [\"Scale\", \"4-Signal MAE\", \"2-Signal MAE\", \"Gap\", \"2-Signal AUC\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.5B\", \"2.3pp\", \"6.8pp\", \"+4.5pp\", 0.508]\n          - [\"1.5B\", \"1.4pp\", \"2.8pp\", \"+1.4pp\", 0.782]\n          - [\"3B\", \"1.6pp\", \"2.1pp\", \"+0.5pp\", 0.831]\n          - [\"Average\", \"1.8pp\", \"3.9pp\", \"+2.1pp\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4-signal vs 2-signal MAE bar chart by scale。标注 DCR baseline 作为参考线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Closed-weight mode 在 1.5B+ 仍提供有意义的 calibration (MAE 2.1-2.8pp)，\n      优于或持平 DCR。在 0.5B 时近似失效——论文应明确声明 \"closed-weight\n      mode requires ≥1.5B models for reliable calibration.\" 这是 practical\n      guidance for practitioners evaluating closed-source models。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-014: Multi-Family Validation\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"multi_family_validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.2-1B 上重复 3-dosage (d000/d025/d100) controlled\n      SFT injection。验证 cross-family generalization。\n    expected_results:\n      # Llama-3.2-1B baseline\n      llama_d000_mmlu: 0.492\n      llama_d000_gsm8k: 0.456\n      llama_d000_arc: 0.652\n      # Contamination inflation\n      llama_d025_mmlu: 0.508\n      llama_d025_gsm8k: 0.478\n      llama_d100_mmlu: 0.521\n      llama_d100_gsm8k: 0.583\n      llama_d100_arc: 0.671\n      # Signal quality\n      S1_auc_llama_d005: 0.962\n      S2_auc_llama_d005: 0.698\n      S4_auc_llama_d005: 0.671\n      # Calibration\n      calibration_mae_pp_llama: 2.1\n      ci95_coverage_llama: 0.92\n      # Cross-family consistency\n      gamma_mmlu_llama: 0.19\n      gamma_gsm8k_llama: 0.72\n      gamma_consistency_with_qwen_pearson: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.2-1B (~1B scale) 的信号质量介于 Qwen 0.5B 和 1.5B 之间\n      （S2 AUC 0.698 接近但未达 0.70 threshold），符合 scale-dependent\n      pattern。contamination inflation 模式与 Qwen 一致：GSM8K 敏感\n      (d100 +12.7pp)，MMLU 中等 (d100 +2.9pp)。γ 估计与 Qwen 高度\n      相关（Pearson 0.91）——GSM8K 仍是最易受影响的 benchmark。\n      calibration MAE 2.1pp 略高于 Qwen 1.5B 的 1.4pp 因为 Llama 1B\n      的信号质量稍低。这为 reviewer concern #11 (single model family)\n      提供 rebuttal evidence，同时确认 identifiability boundaries\n      和 benchmark-specific γ patterns generalize across families。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Family γ Comparison\"\n        headers: [\"Benchmark\", \"Qwen2.5 γ\", \"Llama-3.2 γ\", \"Difference\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", 0.22, 0.19, \"-0.03\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", 0.85, 0.72, \"-0.13\"]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", 0.18, 0.16, \"-0.02\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-family γ scatter: x=Qwen γ_k, y=Llama γ_k, 3 points (per benchmark)。高 correlation 线性趋势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Multi-family validation 确认核心发现的 generalizability。γ 跨家族\n      高度一致说明 benchmark-specific contamination susceptibility 是\n      benchmark 自身的属性（item structure, format, memorizability），\n      而非模型家族特异的。Llama 的 S2 AUC (0.698) 刚好在 0.70 threshold\n      以下，验证了 1B scale 是 Min-K++ 的 borderline regime——\n      与 simulation sweep 的 practical boundary 预测吻合。\n```\n\nSummary: 在 best 档下，11 个实验的预测结果内在一致且互相支撑。核心数字是 exp-006 的 MAE 1.8pp / coverage 94% / Kendall τ 0.96，由 exp-002/008 的多尺度信号恢复（S2 AUC 0.74@1.5B）、exp-004 的可辨识性验证（AUC≥0.70 threshold）、exp-005 的 ME 模型 coverage gap closure 共同支撑。三条 Claims 均有充分实验证据，无需降级。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7201,"cache_read_input_tokens":64290,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7201},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"93e56223-49e0-4a11-b4de-68f1c155e35a","uuid":"6db4987f-5959-4f1b-a9bc-296e96c886b7"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":945883,"duration_api_ms":945377,"num_turns":10,"result":"I have all the grounding data. Now I'll produce the comprehensive best-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Original framing 完全成立，三条 Claims 无需降级。\n  Headline: \"ContamCal recovers true benchmark performance within 1.8pp MAE\n  (bootstrap 95% CI: [1.2, 2.4]) with 94% credible interval coverage, while\n  naive scores overestimate by up to 58pp under full contamination (3B GSM8K).\"\n  C2 story: scale-dependent signal effectiveness validated —— S1 Embedding\n  跨尺度稳健 (AUC>0.95), S2 Min-K++ 和 S4 Self-Critique 在 0.5B 失效\n  (AUC≈0.47) 但在 1.5B+ 恢复 (AUC>0.70)。Min-K++ 方向性反转 (Cohen's d\n  -1.2 to -2.7 at d100) 作为独立 cautionary finding。RRF 在 1.5B+ 实现真正\n  多信号融合（非 S1 单信号主导）。C3: 测量误差模型将 coverage 从 ~82%\n  提升至 94%，Fisher Information 推导确认 AUC≥0.55 为结构可辨识边界，\n  AUC≥0.70 为实用边界。Paper structure 按 paper_framing.md 原样执行。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-002: Stage 1 Signal Pipeline (multi-scale)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"stage1_signal_pipeline\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      在 exp-001 所有模型上计算 4 路检测信号。0.5B 数据已由 exp_002_signals_05B\n      完成，此处预测 1.5B/3B 扩展结果。核心期望：S2(Min-K++) 和 S4(Self-Critique)\n      在 1.5B+ 恢复辨别力。\n    expected_results:\n      # 0.5B 已有数据 (exp-008 v4 实测)\n      S1_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.979\n      S2_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.465\n      S4_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.481\n      # 1.5B 预测\n      S1_d005_auc_15B_mmlu: 0.961\n      S1_d005_auc_15B_gsm8k: 0.985\n      S1_d005_auc_15B_arc: 0.990\n      S2_d005_auc_15B_mmlu: 0.718\n      S2_d005_auc_15B_gsm8k: 0.762\n      S2_d005_auc_15B_arc: 0.741\n      S3_d005_auc_15B_mmlu: 0.795\n      S3_d005_auc_15B_gsm8k: 0.832\n      S3_d005_auc_15B_arc: 0.814\n      S4_d005_auc_15B_mmlu: 0.692\n      S4_d005_auc_15B_gsm8k: 0.731\n      S4_d005_auc_15B_arc: 0.712\n      # 3B 预测\n      S1_d005_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.948\n      S1_d005_auc_3B_gsm8k: 0.982\n      S1_d005_auc_3B_arc: 0.991\n      S2_d005_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.798\n      S2_d005_auc_3B_gsm8k: 0.842\n      S2_d005_auc_3B_arc: 0.816\n      S3_d005_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.836\n      S3_d005_auc_3B_gsm8k: 0.873\n      S3_d005_auc_3B_arc: 0.855\n      S4_d005_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.751\n      S4_d005_auc_3B_gsm8k: 0.792\n      S4_d005_auc_3B_arc: 0.775\n      # d100 cross-model Cohen's d (Min-K++ 反转持续但衰减)\n      S2_d100_cohens_d_15B_mean: -1.52\n      S2_d100_cohens_d_3B_mean: -1.14\n      S1_d100_cohens_d_15B_mean: 3.85\n      S1_d100_cohens_d_3B_mean: 4.02\n    result_rationale: >\n      S2 (Min-K++) 在 1.5B+ 恢复的核心机制：更大模型有更强的 token-level\n      memorization capacity（LoRA adapter 从 34MB/0.5B → 71MB/1.5B → 115MB/3B），\n      paraphrase 训练数据在模型中留下更可检测的 token probability 指纹。\n      0.5B 容量有限，LoRA 微调不足以产生可区分的 memorization 信号。\n      S4 (Self-Critique) 恢复的机制：Self-Critique 本质是生成任务，要求模型\n      对自身知识来源进行元认知。0.5B 生成质量太差（自我评估近似随机噪声），\n      1.5B+ 可产生足够连贯的自我评估，contaminated items 呈现特征性低熵模式。\n      S3 (ConStat) 在 1.5B+ 表现更好因为更强模型对 memorized original items\n      vs unseen paraphrases 产生更大的 performance gap。S2 d100 反转持续但\n      幅度减弱（-1.52 at 1.5B vs -1.98 at 0.5B），因为更大模型的 perplexity\n      distribution 更稳定，全量污染导致的分布偏移相对减小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Signal × Scale × Benchmark AUC at d005\"\n        headers: [\"Signal\", \"Benchmark\", \"0.5B\", \"1.5B\", \"3B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"S1 Embedding\", \"MMLU\", 0.953, 0.961, 0.948]\n          - [\"S1 Embedding\", \"GSM8K\", 0.988, 0.985, 0.982]\n          - [\"S1 Embedding\", \"ARC-C\", 0.995, 0.990, 0.991]\n          - [\"S2 Min-K++\", \"MMLU\", 0.466, 0.718, 0.798]\n          - [\"S2 Min-K++\", \"GSM8K\", 0.465, 0.762, 0.842]\n          - [\"S2 Min-K++\", \"ARC-C\", 0.466, 0.741, 0.816]\n          - [\"S3 ConStat\", \"MMLU\", \"~0.55\", 0.795, 0.836]\n          - [\"S3 ConStat\", \"GSM8K\", \"~0.53\", 0.832, 0.873]\n          - [\"S3 ConStat\", \"ARC-C\", \"~0.52\", 0.814, 0.855]\n          - [\"S4 Self-Critique\", \"MMLU\", 0.517, 0.692, 0.751]\n          - [\"S4 Self-Critique\", \"GSM8K\", 0.495, 0.731, 0.792]\n          - [\"S4 Self-Critique\", \"ARC-C\", 0.433, 0.712, 0.775]\n      - name: \"Min-K++ d100 Cross-Model Cohen's d (方向性反转)\"\n        headers: [\"Benchmark\", \"0.5B\", \"1.5B\", \"3B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", -1.22, -1.08, -0.85]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", -2.67, -1.78, -1.31]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", -2.05, -1.71, -1.26]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Signal × Scale AUC heatmap (3 panels: 0.5B/1.5B/3B)，x-axis=benchmark，y-axis=signal，颜色=AUC。清晰展示 S2/S4 从冷色(0.5B)到暖色(3B)的渐变恢复。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Scale-dependent signal effectiveness 的核心证据。0.5B→1.5B 跨越了\n      Min-K++ 有效性的 capacity threshold（AUC 从 0.47 跃至 0.74），\n      0.5B→3B 更进一步（0.47→0.82）。Self-Critique 在 1.5B 恢复到\n      0.71 刚好过 0.70 threshold。S1 Embedding 跨尺度稳定在 0.95+\n      ——不受尺度影响因为它是 training-data-independent 的语义相似度信号。\n      这为 C2 \"method-specific, scale-dependent\" framing 提供直接证据。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-003: RRF Aggregation Ablation\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"rrf_aggregation_ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      4 信号 RRF 融合及消融实验。测试单信号 vs RRF 在不同尺度下的表现，\n      验证 RRF 在 1.5B+ 实现真正多信号融合。\n    expected_results:\n      # RRF composite AUC at d005 (averaged across benchmarks)\n      rrf_4signal_auc_05B: 0.962\n      rrf_4signal_auc_15B: 0.924\n      rrf_4signal_auc_3B: 0.943\n      # Single-signal baselines at d005 (benchmark-averaged)\n      single_S1_auc_05B: 0.979\n      single_S1_auc_15B: 0.972\n      single_S1_auc_3B: 0.964\n      single_S2_auc_05B: 0.465\n      single_S2_auc_15B: 0.740\n      single_S2_auc_3B: 0.819\n      single_S3_auc_05B: 0.533\n      single_S3_auc_15B: 0.814\n      single_S3_auc_3B: 0.855\n      single_S4_auc_05B: 0.481\n      single_S4_auc_15B: 0.712\n      single_S4_auc_3B: 0.773\n      # RRF vs alternatives\n      equal_weight_rank_avg_auc_15B: 0.908\n      calibrated_weighted_rrf_auc_15B: 0.931\n      # Closed-weight 2-signal (S3+S4 only)\n      rrf_2signal_auc_05B: 0.508\n      rrf_2signal_auc_15B: 0.782\n      rrf_2signal_auc_3B: 0.831\n      # FP injection robustness\n      fp_injection_5pct_auc_drop: 0.008\n      fp_injection_10pct_auc_drop: 0.014\n      fp_injection_15pct_auc_drop: 0.023\n      # RRF signal dominance ratio at 0.5B\n      rrf_05B_S1_weight_share: 0.89\n      rrf_15B_S1_weight_share: 0.38\n      rrf_3B_S1_weight_share: 0.31\n    result_rationale: >\n      0.5B RRF (0.962) 低于单独 S1 (0.979)，因为 S2/S4 近似随机噪声拉低\n      融合质量——RRF 的 rank fusion 无法区分有效和无效信号。这是 honest\n      characterization of degraded regime。0.5B 的 S1 weight share 达 89%\n      说明 RRF 退化为近似单信号模式。1.5B RRF (0.924) 虽然低于单独 S1\n      (0.972)，但高于任何非 S1 单信号，且通过 precision 提升（false positive\n      reduction）在 IRT 下游产生更好的 exposure estimates。3B RRF (0.943)\n      接近 S1 水平同时整合其他信号的互补信息。calibrated weighted RRF\n      (0.931 at 1.5B) 比标准 RRF (0.924) 略优但差距不大——验证了 RRF\n      作为 training-free 方案的合理性。FP injection 鲁棒性好（15% FP 仅\n      降 2.3% AUC），因为 RRF 的 rank-based aggregation 天然抗异常值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RRF vs Single-Signal AUC (d005, benchmark-averaged)\"\n        headers: [\"Method\", \"0.5B\", \"1.5B\", \"3B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"RRF 4-signal\", 0.962, 0.924, 0.943]\n          - [\"S1 only\", 0.979, 0.972, 0.964]\n          - [\"S2 only\", 0.465, 0.740, 0.819]\n          - [\"S3 only\", 0.533, 0.814, 0.855]\n          - [\"S4 only\", 0.481, 0.712, 0.773]\n          - [\"RRF 2-signal (closed)\", 0.508, 0.782, 0.831]\n          - [\"Equal-weight rank avg\", \"—\", 0.908, \"—\"]\n          - [\"Calibrated weighted RRF\", \"—\", 0.931, \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"RRF signal contribution 分析图：stacked bar chart 展示各信号在 RRF composite 中的贡献比例，0.5B 几乎全为 S1，1.5B/3B 呈均匀分布。\"\n    analysis: >\n      RRF 在 0.5B 退化为 S1-dominated（weight share 89%）是预期的、正确的行为。\n      论文应 honestly 报告这一 degradation 并强调：(1) RRF 的价值在 1.5B+ 显现，\n      实现真正多信号融合; (2) 即使在 0.5B，RRF 的 graceful degradation 优于\n      hard failure; (3) FP robustness 证明 RRF 是比 learned aggregation 更稳健\n      的选择（meta-circularity argument 成立）。calibrated weighted RRF 微弱优势\n      不足以 justify 引入 training 依赖。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-004 v2: Simulation Identifiability Sweep (completion)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"simulation_identifiability_sweep_v2\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: >\n      完成 120-condition simulation sweep。已有 48/120 条完成\n      （AUC=0.55 全部完成，AUC=0.80 部分）。预测全部完成后的结果。\n    expected_results:\n      # AUC=0.55 (已有数据的延伸)\n      auc055_n20_gamma_bias: 0.020\n      auc055_n20_gamma_rmse: 0.040\n      auc055_n20_ci95_width_pp: 13.3\n      auc055_n20_ci95_coverage: 0.80\n      auc055_n50_gamma_bias: 0.015\n      auc055_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.026\n      auc055_n50_ci95_width_pp: 8.7\n      auc055_n50_ci95_coverage: 0.90\n      auc055_n100_gamma_bias: -0.003\n      auc055_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.004\n      auc055_n100_ci95_width_pp: 6.5\n      auc055_n100_ci95_coverage: 1.0\n      # AUC=0.65 (预测)\n      auc065_n20_gamma_bias: 0.016\n      auc065_n20_gamma_rmse: 0.035\n      auc065_n20_ci95_width_pp: 11.8\n      auc065_n20_ci95_coverage: 0.85\n      auc065_n50_gamma_bias: 0.010\n      auc065_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.020\n      auc065_n50_ci95_width_pp: 7.6\n      auc065_n50_ci95_coverage: 0.93\n      auc065_n100_gamma_bias: -0.004\n      auc065_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.008\n      auc065_n100_ci95_width_pp: 5.8\n      auc065_n100_ci95_coverage: 0.97\n      # AUC=0.70 (关键阈值)\n      auc070_n50_gamma_bias: 0.008\n      auc070_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.018\n      auc070_n50_ci95_width_pp: 7.0\n      auc070_n50_ci95_coverage: 0.95\n      auc070_n100_gamma_bias: -0.002\n      auc070_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.006\n      auc070_n100_ci95_width_pp: 5.3\n      auc070_n100_ci95_coverage: 0.98\n      # AUC=0.80 (更多 seeds 确认)\n      auc080_n50_gamma_bias: 0.006\n      auc080_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.014\n      auc080_n50_ci95_width_pp: 6.2\n      auc080_n50_ci95_coverage: 0.96\n      auc080_n100_gamma_bias: 0.003\n      auc080_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.005\n      auc080_n100_ci95_width_pp: 4.8\n      auc080_n100_ci95_coverage: 0.98\n      # AUC=0.90\n      auc090_n50_gamma_bias: 0.004\n      auc090_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.010\n      auc090_n50_ci95_width_pp: 5.4\n      auc090_n50_ci95_coverage: 0.97\n      auc090_n100_gamma_bias: 0.002\n      auc090_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.004\n      auc090_n100_ci95_width_pp: 4.2\n      auc090_n100_ci95_coverage: 0.99\n      # Prior sensitivity\n      prior_sd05_ci_narrowing_pct: 18\n      prior_sd20_ci_widening_pct: 28\n      # Continuous exposure\n      continuous_vs_binary_ci_ratio: 0.92\n      # Fisher Information key result\n      fisher_info_auc_threshold_structural: 0.52\n      fisher_info_auc_threshold_practical: 0.70\n      # Growing Pains at N=20\n      growing_pains_n20_ci_narrowing_pct: 22\n      # MCMC quality\n      total_divergences: 0\n      max_rhat_across_all: 1.012\n      median_fit_time_sec: 1150\n    result_rationale: >\n      AUC=0.80 N=50 的 CI width (6.2pp) 相比初步 1-seed 的 16.2pp 大幅下降——\n      初始异常值被 seed 平均消除（1-seed 结果是极端离群值，10-seed 平均\n      回归到与趋势一致的水平）。CI width 随 AUC 单调递减（从 0.55 的 8.7pp\n      到 0.90 的 5.4pp at N=50）符合 Fisher Information 预测：I(γ) 随 AUC\n      增大，posterior uncertainty 随之收缩。CI width 随 N 按 ~1/√N 缩放\n      （实测比率 N20/N100 = 2.04 at AUC=0.55，理论 2.24）。\n      coverage 在 N=20 时低于 nominal (80-85%) 因为少量 examinee 导致\n      posterior 过于集中——这是已知的 small-N IRT limitation。N≥50 时\n      coverage 达 90%+，N=100 时接近 nominal。Fisher Information 推导\n      给出 structural identifiability 下界 AUC≈0.52（I(γ)>0 的理论保证），\n      practical threshold AUC≈0.70 定义为 \"CI95 width < 10pp at N=50\"。\n      连续 exposure 比 binary 产生 ~8% 更窄的 CI，因为连续值提供更多\n      信息。Growing Pains pre-estimation 在 N=20 缩窄 CI ~22%，因为\n      借用外部数据的 item parameter 估计减少了参数不确定性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"γ Recovery: AUC × N_models Grid (γ_true=0.5)\"\n        headers: [\"AUC\", \"N\", \"Bias\", \"RMSE\", \"CI95 Width (pp)\", \"Coverage 95%\", \"θ Corr\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.55, 20, \"+0.020\", 0.040, 13.3, \"80%\", 0.958]\n          - [0.55, 50, \"+0.015\", 0.026, 8.7, \"90%\", 0.947]\n          - [0.55, 100, \"−0.003\", 0.004, 6.5, \"100%\", 0.950]\n          - [0.65, 20, \"+0.016\", 0.035, 11.8, \"85%\", 0.955]\n          - [0.65, 50, \"+0.010\", 0.020, 7.6, \"93%\", 0.952]\n          - [0.65, 100, \"−0.004\", 0.008, 5.8, \"97%\", 0.956]\n          - [0.70, 50, \"+0.008\", 0.018, 7.0, \"95%\", 0.958]\n          - [0.70, 100, \"−0.002\", 0.006, 5.3, \"98%\", 0.961]\n          - [0.80, 50, \"+0.006\", 0.014, 6.2, \"96%\", 0.960]\n          - [0.80, 100, \"+0.003\", 0.005, 4.8, \"98%\", 0.965]\n          - [0.90, 50, \"+0.004\", 0.010, 5.4, \"97%\", 0.964]\n          - [0.90, 100, \"+0.002\", 0.004, 4.2, \"99%\", 0.968]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Identifiability phase diagram: x=AUC, y=N_models, 颜色=CI95 width。10pp 等高线标注 practical boundary。\"\n      - \"Fisher Information I(γ) vs AUC 理论曲线叠加 empirical CI width，验证解析预测与模拟一致。\"\n    analysis: >\n      AUC≥0.70 at N≥50 为 practical identifiability sweet spot（CI<7pp,\n      coverage≥95%）。这正好对应 best tier 的 S2 AUC at 1.5B (~0.74)，\n      意味着 1.5B 模型的 Min-K++ 信号刚好越过 practical threshold。\n      AUC=0.55 仍可识别（CI<9pp at N≥50）但 coverage 仅 90%——需要\n      measurement error model 补偿。Fisher Information 推导提供理论根基，\n      解决 reviewer concern #1。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-005 v3: Noise Propagation & Measurement Error Model\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"noise_propagation_analysis_v3\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      测量误差模型将 Stage 1 信号不确定性传播至 IRT posterior。当前 v3\n      在 σ_e=0.1 条件下 ME 与 simple 模型差异不显著（γ 偏差问题待修复）。\n      Best tier 预测在更高 σ_e 条件下 ME 模型展现明确优势。\n    expected_results:\n      # σ_e=0.1 (低噪声，已有数据修正后)\n      sigma01_me_gamma_bias: 0.02\n      sigma01_me_gamma_rmse: 0.04\n      sigma01_me_ci95_coverage: 0.95\n      sigma01_me_ci_width_pp: 5.2\n      sigma01_simple_gamma_bias: 0.03\n      sigma01_simple_ci95_coverage: 0.91\n      sigma01_simple_ci_width_pp: 4.8\n      # σ_e=0.3 (中等噪声，ME 优势显现)\n      sigma03_me_gamma_bias: 0.04\n      sigma03_me_gamma_rmse: 0.07\n      sigma03_me_ci95_coverage: 0.93\n      sigma03_me_ci_width_pp: 7.8\n      sigma03_simple_gamma_bias: 0.09\n      sigma03_simple_ci95_coverage: 0.78\n      sigma03_simple_ci_width_pp: 5.1\n      # σ_e=0.5 (高噪声)\n      sigma05_me_gamma_bias: 0.06\n      sigma05_me_gamma_rmse: 0.11\n      sigma05_me_ci95_coverage: 0.91\n      sigma05_me_ci_width_pp: 11.4\n      sigma05_simple_gamma_bias: 0.18\n      sigma05_simple_ci95_coverage: 0.65\n      sigma05_simple_ci_width_pp: 5.3\n      # Post-hoc noise injection (Part B)\n      noise_1x_ci_widening_pct: 28\n      noise_15x_ci_widening_pct: 52\n      noise_2x_ci_widening_pct: 83\n      # Coverage gap closure\n      coverage_gap_simple_vs_nominal: 0.13\n      coverage_gap_me_vs_nominal: 0.01\n    result_rationale: >\n      当前 v3 结果中 γ 偏差问题（seed 42: 0.793 vs true 0.5, seed 43: 0.402）\n      源于模型中 latent τ prior 与真实 exposure 分布不匹配——在 best tier，\n      这通过 prior calibration (使用 exp-001 ground-truth FP/FN rates 估计\n      σ_e) 和增加 seeds (20+ seeds 平均) 得到解决。σ_e=0.1 时 ME vs simple\n      差异小（覆盖 95% vs 91%），因为低噪声下 point-estimate exposure\n      已足够好。σ_e=0.3 时差异显著（93% vs 78%），因为 simple 模型将噪声\n      错误归因为真实 exposure variation，导致 γ 被高估且 CI 过窄。ME 模型\n      通过显式建模 noise 产生更宽但更诚实的 CI。σ_e=0.5 时 ME 覆盖仍有\n      91%（略低于 nominal），因为高噪声下即使 ME 模型也难以完全分离\n      signal 和 noise。simple 模型在 σ_e=0.5 时严重失效（65% coverage）。\n      Post-hoc noise injection的 CI widening 与 σ_e 水平呈超线性关系。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"ME vs Simple Model Coverage (95% nominal)\"\n        headers: [\"σ_e\", \"ME Coverage\", \"ME CI Width (pp)\", \"Simple Coverage\", \"Simple CI Width (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.1, \"95%\", 5.2, \"91%\", 4.8]\n          - [0.3, \"93%\", 7.8, \"78%\", 5.1]\n          - [0.5, \"91%\", 11.4, \"65%\", 5.3]\n      - name: \"Post-hoc Noise Injection CI Widening\"\n        headers: [\"Noise Level\", \"γ CI Widening\", \"θ CI Widening\", \"Coverage Change\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1.0×\", \"+28%\", \"+15%\", \"−3pp\"]\n          - [\"1.5×\", \"+52%\", \"+31%\", \"−8pp\"]\n          - [\"2.0×\", \"+83%\", \"+48%\", \"−15pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Coverage vs σ_e 双线图：ME model 维持在 nominal 附近，simple model 随 σ_e 增大快速下降。\"\n    analysis: >\n      ME 模型是 C3 claims 的关键基础设施。在真实场景中 σ_e ≈ 0.15-0.30\n      （基于 exp-002 signal pipeline 的 FP/FN rates），ME 模型将 coverage\n      从 ~78-91% 提升至 93-95%。这解决了 exp-004 simulation sweep 中\n      发现的 coverage gap（尤其在 low-AUC/small-N regime）。CI width\n      增加是必要代价——更宽的 CI 反映了 genuine epistemic uncertainty。\n      论文中框架为：\"Models with high-AUC signals get tighter CIs;\n      those with degraded signals get appropriately wider CIs.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-006: IRT Calibration & Baselines (Headline Experiment)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"irt_calibration_and_baselines\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      核心实验。4PL+γ IRT per-benchmark fitting on 3 scales × 5 dosages ×\n      3 seeds = 45 model instances per benchmark。与 7 baselines 对比\n      5 metrics。best tier: 全面优于所有 baselines。\n    expected_results:\n      # ===== Aggregate metrics (across 3 benchmarks, 3 scales, 4 dosages) =====\n      # Ours: 4PL+γ with ME model\n      ours_mae_pp: 1.8\n      ours_mae_bootstrap_lo: 1.2\n      ours_mae_bootstrap_hi: 2.4\n      ours_ci95_coverage: 0.94\n      ours_ci80_coverage: 0.83\n      ours_ci50_coverage: 0.52\n      ours_ci_width_avg_pp: 4.2\n      ours_kendall_tau: 0.96\n      ours_dose_response_monotonicity: 0.95\n      # Baseline 0: Raw (no adjustment)\n      b0_raw_mae_pp: 8.2\n      b0_raw_kendall_tau: 0.87\n      # Baseline 1: Remove-and-rescore\n      b1_remove_mae_pp: 4.6\n      b1_remove_kendall_tau: 0.91\n      # Baseline 2: Single-signal 2PL+γ (best signal = S1)\n      b2_single_2pl_mae_pp: 2.9\n      b2_single_2pl_ci95_coverage: 0.81\n      b2_single_2pl_ci_width_pp: 5.6\n      b2_single_2pl_kendall_tau: 0.94\n      # Baseline 3: Vanilla 4PL (no γ)\n      b3_vanilla_4pl_mae_pp: 6.5\n      b3_vanilla_4pl_ci95_coverage: 0.58\n      b3_vanilla_4pl_ci_width_pp: 3.2\n      b3_vanilla_4pl_kendall_tau: 0.89\n      # Baseline 4: Linear exposure regression + bootstrap CI\n      b4_linear_mae_pp: 3.2\n      b4_linear_ci95_coverage: 0.76\n      b4_linear_ci_width_pp: 6.8\n      b4_linear_kendall_tau: 0.93\n      # Baseline 5: Emperor's mitigation (rephrase + shuffle)\n      b5_emperor_mae_pp: 5.8\n      b5_emperor_kendall_tau: 0.89\n      # Baseline 6: DCR fuzzy (EMNLP 2025)\n      b6_dcr_mae_pp: 3.9\n      b6_dcr_kendall_tau: 0.92\n      # ===== Per-benchmark breakdown =====\n      # MMLU\n      ours_mmlu_mae_pp: 1.1\n      b0_raw_mmlu_mae_pp: 4.3\n      b6_dcr_mmlu_mae_pp: 2.5\n      # GSM8K (most challenging due to 3B 57pp inflation)\n      ours_gsm8k_mae_pp: 2.8\n      b0_raw_gsm8k_mae_pp: 14.6\n      b6_dcr_gsm8k_mae_pp: 6.2\n      # ARC-Challenge\n      ours_arc_mae_pp: 1.2\n      b0_raw_arc_mae_pp: 4.8\n      b6_dcr_arc_mae_pp: 2.8\n      # ===== Per-scale breakdown (our method) =====\n      ours_05B_mae_pp: 2.3\n      ours_15B_mae_pp: 1.4\n      ours_3B_mae_pp: 1.6\n      # ===== IRT parameter estimates =====\n      # Per-benchmark γ_k\n      gamma_mmlu_mean: 0.22\n      gamma_mmlu_ci: [0.08, 0.38]\n      gamma_gsm8k_mean: 0.85\n      gamma_gsm8k_ci: [0.62, 1.12]\n      gamma_arc_mean: 0.18\n      gamma_arc_ci: [0.04, 0.34]\n      # γ heterogeneity across benchmarks (supports per-benchmark fitting)\n      gamma_heterogeneity_chi2_p: 0.002\n      # Joint model ablation (shared global γ)\n      joint_gamma_global: 0.41\n      joint_gamma_mae_pp: 2.6\n      # Posterior predictive check (local independence)\n      residual_correlation_mean: 0.032\n      residual_correlation_max: 0.085\n      # MCMC diagnostics\n      mcmc_divergences: 0\n      mcmc_max_rhat: 1.008\n      mcmc_min_ess: 850\n      mcmc_fit_time_per_benchmark_min: 45\n    result_rationale: >\n      MAE 1.8pp (CI [1.2, 2.4]) 的分解：\n      MMLU (1.1pp) 最低因为污染效应小（0.5B 的 forgetting 被 θ 下降吸收，\n      1.5B/3B 的 inflation 仅 0.5-1.8pp 容易矫正）。\n      GSM8K (2.8pp) 最高因为 3B 的 57pp inflation 要求巨大矫正——即使 IRT\n      模型准确估计 γ=0.85，exposure-score 中的噪声在乘以 γ 后放大为\n      ~3pp residual。ARC (1.2pp) 居中。\n      0.5B MAE (2.3pp) 高于 1.5B/3B 因为：(1) 0.5B 信号质量差（仅 S1\n      有效，exposure 估计噪声大）；(2) catastrophic forgetting 使 θ 和 γ\n      效应交织。ME 模型在 0.5B 条件下产生更宽 CI 以补偿。\n      γ_k heterogeneity (p=0.002) 证明 per-benchmark fitting 优于\n      joint fitting——GSM8K 的 γ=0.85 远高于 MMLU/ARC 的 0.18-0.22，\n      反映 MC 格式对 memorization 的易感性差异。\n      joint model (shared γ=0.41) MAE 2.6pp > per-benchmark 1.8pp,\n      确认 heterogeneity matters。\n      Baselines 排序：DCR (3.9) > Linear (3.2) > Single-2PL+γ (2.9) > ours (1.8)。\n      DCR 的 6.2pp GSM8K MAE 暴露了它对 large inflation 的处理弱点。\n      Vanilla 4PL (6.5pp) 接近 Raw (8.2pp) 因为没有 contamination modeling\n      的 IRT 将 inflation 错误吸收进 θ。Emperor (5.8pp) 确认 mitigation\n      策略不足以消除 contamination effect。\n      Coverage 0.94 接近 nominal 0.95（ME model 功劳），而 Simple model\n      (B2, B3) 覆盖仅 58-81%——vanilla 4PL 的 58% 说明不建模 contamination\n      的 IRT 产出过窄、错误的 CI。\n      Kendall τ=0.96 说明 calibrated ranking 高度保真。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Main Results: 8 Methods × 5 Metrics\"\n        headers: [\"Method\", \"MAE (pp)↓\", \"95% Coverage↑\", \"CI Width (pp)↓\", \"Kendall τ↑\", \"Monotonicity\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"4PL+γ ME (ours)\", \"1.8 [1.2,2.4]\", \"94%\", 4.2, 0.96, 0.95]\n          - [\"B0: Raw\", 8.2, \"—\", \"—\", 0.87, \"—\"]\n          - [\"B1: Remove-rescore\", 4.6, \"—\", \"—\", 0.91, \"—\"]\n          - [\"B2: 2PL+γ (S1 only)\", 2.9, \"81%\", 5.6, 0.94, 0.90]\n          - [\"B3: Vanilla 4PL\", 6.5, \"58%\", 3.2, 0.89, \"—\"]\n          - [\"B4: Linear reg + boot\", 3.2, \"76%\", 6.8, 0.93, 0.85]\n          - [\"B5: Emperor mitigation\", 5.8, \"—\", \"—\", 0.89, \"—\"]\n          - [\"B6: DCR fuzzy\", 3.9, \"—\", \"—\", 0.92, 0.80]\n      - name: \"Per-Benchmark MAE (pp): Our Method vs Key Baselines\"\n        headers: [\"Benchmark\", \"4PL+γ ME\", \"B0 Raw\", \"B2 2PL+γ\", \"B4 Linear\", \"B6 DCR\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", 1.1, 4.3, 1.8, 2.1, 2.5]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", 2.8, 14.6, 4.2, 5.1, 6.2]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", 1.2, 4.8, 2.0, 2.2, 2.8]\n          - [\"Average\", 1.8, 8.2, 2.9, 3.2, 3.9]\n      - name: \"Per-Benchmark γ_k Estimates\"\n        headers: [\"Benchmark\", \"γ_k mean\", \"95% CI\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", 0.22, \"[0.08, 0.38]\", \"MC memorization 产生中等 inflation\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", 0.85, \"[0.62, 1.12]\", \"生成式任务极易被 answer memorization 加速\"]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", 0.18, \"[0.04, 0.34]\", \"MC 格式但 science reasoning 部分抗 memorization\"]\n      - name: \"Dose-Response: 3B GSM8K (最戏剧性案例)\"\n        headers: [\"Dosage\", \"Observed\", \"Calibrated (ours)\", \"True (d000)\", \"Residual\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"d000 (0%)\", \"12.0%\", \"—\", \"12.0%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"d005 (5%)\", \"20.8%\", \"13.2%\", \"12.0%\", \"+1.2pp\"]\n          - [\"d025 (25%)\", \"~35.4%\", \"14.5%\", \"12.0%\", \"+2.5pp\"]\n          - [\"d050 (50%)\", \"~51.8%\", \"15.1%\", \"12.0%\", \"+3.1pp\"]\n          - [\"d100 (100%)\", \"69.7%\", \"16.2%\", \"12.0%\", \"+4.2pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Calibrated-vs-true scatter plot with CIs: 每个点是一个 (model, benchmark) pair，x=true score, y=calibrated score。4PL+γ 点紧贴对角线，CI bars 覆盖真值。baselines 散布更广。\"\n      - \"Dose-response 曲线 (3B GSM8K): x=dosage, y=accuracy。三条线：observed (陡增), raw baseline (同 observed), calibrated (近水平)。CI band 覆盖 true score。\"\n      - \"Per-benchmark γ_k posterior density plot: MMLU/ARC 集中在 0.2 附近，GSM8K 在 0.85——直观展示 benchmark heterogeneity。\"\n      - \"Reliability diagram: calibrated probability vs empirical accuracy, 对比 ours vs B3 vanilla 4PL。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的 Table 1。核心叙事：(1) ContamCal MAE 1.8pp 显著优于最佳\n      baseline DCR 的 3.9pp (bootstrap p<0.01)；(2) 唯一提供 near-nominal\n      coverage 的方法（94% vs baselines 的 58-81%）；(3) γ_k heterogeneity\n      证明 per-benchmark fitting 的必要性——GSM8K γ=0.85 vs MMLU γ=0.22\n      差异 4 倍，joint model 会 overfit MMLU 同时 underfit GSM8K；\n      (4) 3B GSM8K dose-response 是最佳可视化案例（57pp inflation 被矫正\n      至 ~4pp residual）。0.5B 的 higher MAE (2.3pp) 和 wider CI 不是缺陷\n      而是 honest UQ——信号差的模型得到更宽的 CI，这恰好是 C3 的核心主张。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-007: 7B Scale Bridging\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"scale_bridging_7b\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B LoRA SFT at 5 dosage levels (d000-d100)。验证\n      calibration 在更大模型上成立。需 multi-GPU (1×H100 per run)。\n    expected_results:\n      # 7B baseline scores (d000)\n      d000_mmlu: 0.718\n      d000_gsm8k: 0.792\n      d000_arc: 0.878\n      d000_humaneval: 0.415\n      # Contamination inflation\n      d005_mmlu_inflation_pp: 0.8\n      d005_gsm8k_inflation_pp: 1.2\n      d025_mmlu_inflation_pp: 2.5\n      d025_gsm8k_inflation_pp: 5.8\n      d100_mmlu_inflation_pp: 4.1\n      d100_gsm8k_inflation_pp: 12.5\n      d100_arc_inflation_pp: 2.8\n      # Signal quality at 7B\n      S1_d005_auc_7B_mean: 0.954\n      S2_d005_auc_7B_mean: 0.871\n      S4_d005_auc_7B_mean: 0.812\n      # Calibration\n      calibration_mae_pp_7B: 1.4\n      ci95_coverage_7B: 0.95\n      kendall_tau_7B: 0.97\n    result_rationale: >\n      7B 有更强的 memorization capacity，contamination inflation 比 3B\n      更显著但更均匀（不像 3B 的 GSM8K 极端案例，因为 7B baseline GSM8K\n      已经 79.2%，天花板效应限制了 inflation 幅度）。MMLU inflation\n      从 3B 的 0.8pp 升至 4.1pp 因为 7B 有更好的 knowledge retrieval\n      能力，memorized items 的 boost 更 pronounced。信号质量在 7B 进一步\n      提升（S2 AUC 0.87, S4 AUC 0.81），验证了 scale-dependent trend\n      的外推。calibration MAE 1.4pp (低于 0.5B-3B 的 1.8pp aggregate)\n      因为 7B 信号质量更好 → exposure 估计更准 → γ 矫正更精确。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"7B Dose-Response\"\n        headers: [\"Dosage\", \"MMLU\", \"GSM8K\", \"ARC-C\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"d000\", \"71.8%\", \"79.2%\", \"87.8%\"]\n          - [\"d005\", \"72.6%\", \"80.4%\", \"88.1%\"]\n          - [\"d025\", \"74.3%\", \"85.0%\", \"89.2%\"]\n          - [\"d100\", \"75.9%\", \"91.7%\", \"90.6%\"]\n      - name: \"7B Signal AUC at d005\"\n        headers: [\"Signal\", \"MMLU\", \"GSM8K\", \"ARC-C\", \"Mean\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"S1 Embedding\", 0.948, 0.971, 0.943, 0.954]\n          - [\"S2 Min-K++\", 0.851, 0.896, 0.865, 0.871]\n          - [\"S3 ConStat\", 0.872, 0.908, 0.881, 0.887]\n          - [\"S4 Self-Critique\", 0.795, 0.834, 0.808, 0.812]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scale-vs-MAE 趋势图: x=model scale (0.5B→7B), y=calibration MAE。展示 MAE 随 scale 下降的趋势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B 结果确认 calibration 可靠性随 scale 提升（MAE 1.4pp < aggregate\n      1.8pp）。信号质量持续改善支持 \"larger models are easier to calibrate\"\n      叙事。7B 作为 controlled experiment 的上界，为 Reviewer Concern #4\n      (scale limited to 3B) 提供直接回应。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-008: Signal Survival Analysis (multi-scale extension)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"signal_survival_multiscale\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      将 exp-008 从 0.5B-only 扩展至 1.5B/3B。这是 C2 \"scale-dependent\"\n      claim 的核心证据。heatmap 图从 1 列扩展为 3 列。\n    expected_results:\n      # Cross-scale signal effectiveness summary\n      effective_signals_05B: 1\n      effective_signals_15B: 3\n      effective_signals_3B: 4\n      # S2 Min-K++ AUC trajectory across scales (d005, benchmark-averaged)\n      S2_auc_trajectory: [0.465, 0.740, 0.819]\n      S2_scale_labels: [\"0.5B\", \"1.5B\", \"3B\"]\n      # S4 Self-Critique trajectory\n      S4_auc_trajectory: [0.481, 0.712, 0.773]\n      # Min-K++ reversal Cohen's d trajectory (d100)\n      S2_reversal_cohens_d_trajectory: [-1.98, -1.52, -1.14]\n      # S1 stability\n      S1_auc_trajectory: [0.979, 0.979, 0.974]\n      # Scale-dependent threshold crossing\n      S2_crosses_070_at_scale: \"1.5B\"\n      S4_crosses_070_at_scale: \"1.5B\"\n      S4_crosses_065_at_scale: \"1.5B\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      S2 从 0.47 (0.5B) → 0.74 (1.5B) → 0.82 (3B) 呈 log-scale 近线性增长，\n      与 memorization capacity 的 scaling 一致。S4 从 0.48 → 0.71 → 0.77，\n      增速略慢因为 Self-Critique 依赖生成质量（不如 token-level 信号对\n      scale 敏感）。S1 跨尺度稳定在 0.97+ 因为 embedding similarity 是\n      training-data-independent 信号。Min-K++ 反转在 1.5B/3B 持续但减弱：\n      1.5B 的 -1.52 和 3B 的 -1.14 vs 0.5B 的 -1.98，因为更大模型的\n      perplexity 分布更稳定，d100 全量污染的 distribution shift 相对更小。\n      0.5B→1.5B 的跃变最大（effective signals 从 1 跳到 3），说明\n      1.5B 是 signal effectiveness 的关键转折点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Signal × Scale Effectiveness Summary\"\n        headers: [\"Signal\", \"0.5B d005 AUC\", \"1.5B d005 AUC\", \"3B d005 AUC\", \"Status\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"S1 Embedding\", 0.979, 0.979, 0.974, \"Robust across scales\"]\n          - [\"S2 Min-K++\", 0.465, 0.740, 0.819, \"Recovers at 1.5B+ (crosses 0.70)\"]\n          - [\"S3 ConStat\", \"~0.53\", 0.814, 0.855, \"Recovers at 1.5B+\"]\n          - [\"S4 Self-Critique\", 0.481, 0.712, 0.773, \"Recovers at 1.5B+ (crosses 0.70)\"]\n      - name: \"Min-K++ Directional Reversal (d100 Cross-Model Cohen's d)\"\n        headers: [\"Benchmark\", \"0.5B\", \"1.5B\", \"3B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", -1.22, -1.08, -0.85]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", -2.67, -1.78, -1.31]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", -2.05, -1.71, -1.26]\n          - [\"Mean\", -1.98, -1.52, -1.14]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Signal × Scale × Dosage AUC heatmap: Fig.2 of paper。3×4 grid (3 scales × 4 signals)，每格颜色=d005 AUC。0.5B 行仅 S1 为暖色，1.5B/3B 行逐渐变暖。\"\n      - \"Scale-dependent AUC trajectory: line plot, x=scale, y=AUC, 4 lines for 4 signals。S1 水平线，S2/S3/S4 上升曲线，0.70 threshold 虚线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的 Fig.2 和 C2 的核心证据。scale-dependent signal effectiveness\n      在 1.5B crossing point 得到实证验证。Min-K++ 从 \"fails at small scale\"\n      到 \"recovers at larger scale\" 的转变为整个 C2 narrative 提供了\n      convincing evidence。Min-K++ reversal 的 scale attenuation (-1.98 →\n      -1.52 → -1.14) 是 nuanced finding：reversal 在所有尺度持续存在，\n      但严重性降低。论文中框架为 \"Min-K++ should be used with extreme\n      caution at any scale under high contamination dosage.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-009: RL Observational Case Study\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"rl_observational_case_study\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-Instruct (0.5B-7B) 和 DeepSeek-R1-Distill (1.5B/7B)\n      上应用 ContamCal。无 ground truth (observational)，重点是\n      directional external validity。\n    expected_results:\n      # Signal quality on Instruct/RL models\n      S1_auc_instruct_05B: 0.91\n      S1_auc_instruct_15B: 0.93\n      S1_auc_instruct_3B: 0.94\n      S1_auc_instruct_7B: 0.95\n      S2_auc_instruct_15B: 0.62\n      S2_auc_instruct_3B: 0.71\n      # γ estimates on Instruct models\n      gamma_mmlu_instruct: 0.15\n      gamma_mmlu_instruct_ci: [0.02, 0.31]\n      gamma_gsm8k_instruct: 0.42\n      gamma_gsm8k_instruct_ci: [0.18, 0.68]\n      # DeepSeek-R1\n      gamma_mmlu_deepseek: 0.08\n      gamma_mmlu_deepseek_ci: [-0.06, 0.24]\n      # CI widths (should be wider than controlled experiments)\n      ci_width_instruct_avg_pp: 6.8\n      ci_width_deepseek_avg_pp: 8.2\n      # Expected regret: top-5 model selection\n      regret_uncalibrated_rank_changes: 3\n      regret_calibrated_rank_changes: 1\n      # Near-zero γ check (specificity)\n      gamma_known_clean_benchmark: 0.02\n      gamma_known_clean_ci_includes_zero: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Instruct 模型的信号质量低于 controlled SFT 因为 RLHF/DPO post-training\n      扰动了 token-level 统计特征。S1 仍有效但 AUC 略降（0.91-0.95 vs\n      controlled 的 0.95-0.99），S2 在 Instruct 上更难恢复（1.5B 仅 0.62，\n      低于 controlled 的 0.74）因为 RL 进一步模糊了 memorization 信号。\n      γ estimates 对 Instruct 模型较低（MMLU 0.15 vs controlled 0.22）\n      说明 Instruct fine-tuning 部分缓解了 contamination inflation（或者\n      instruction-following 改变了 response 策略）。GSM8K γ 仍较高（0.42）\n      因为 math reasoning 的 contamination 更难被 RL 消除。DeepSeek-R1\n      的 γ CI 包含 0（MMLU: [-0.06, 0.24]），consistent with 可能的低\n      contamination 或 reasoning-focused training 的 decontamination 效果。\n      CI width 更宽（6.8-8.2pp vs controlled 4.2pp）是 honest UQ 的体现。\n      Near-zero γ on clean benchmark (0.02, CI includes 0) 验证 specificity。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RL Observational: Calibrated vs Uncalibrated Ranking\"\n        headers: [\"Model\", \"Uncalib MMLU\", \"Calib MMLU\", \"95% CI\", \"Rank Change\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\", \"47.2%\", \"46.8%\", \"[43.1, 50.5]\", 0]\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\", \"61.5%\", \"60.2%\", \"[56.8, 63.6]\", 0]\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\", \"68.3%\", \"67.1%\", \"[63.5, 70.7]\", 0]\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\", \"74.8%\", \"73.2%\", \"[70.1, 76.3]\", -1]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-R1-1.5B\", \"58.9%\", \"58.4%\", \"[53.8, 63.0]\", +1]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-R1-7B\", \"75.2%\", \"74.6%\", \"[71.0, 78.2]\", 0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Calibrated ranking comparison: paired bar chart showing uncalibrated vs calibrated MMLU scores with CI error bars。排名变化标注。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Observational study 提供 directional external validity。关键发现：\n      (1) Instruct 模型 CI 更宽反映信号质量退化——honest UQ 在 action；\n      (2) GSM8K contamination 在 Instruct 后仍存在（γ=0.42），说明\n      RLHF 未完全消除 memorization；(3) specificity check pass 排除\n      false positive contamination detection；(4) ranking changes 较少\n      (1 out of 6) 说明 calibration 的 ranking impact 是 marginal 但\n      CI widths 差异很大——即使排名不变，uncertainty awareness 也有价值。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-012: 72B Observational\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"observational_72b\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-012\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B inference-only observational分析。验证信号和\n      calibration 在 frontier 模型规模下是否成立。无 SFT，仅推理。\n    expected_results:\n      # 72B baseline scores\n      baseline_mmlu: 0.854\n      baseline_gsm8k: 0.908\n      baseline_arc: 0.943\n      # Signal quality\n      S1_auc_72B: 0.96\n      S2_auc_72B: 0.89\n      S3_auc_72B: 0.91\n      S4_auc_72B: 0.84\n      # γ estimates\n      gamma_mmlu_72B: 0.12\n      gamma_mmlu_72B_ci: [-0.02, 0.28]\n      gamma_gsm8k_72B: 0.18\n      gamma_gsm8k_72B_ci: [0.01, 0.37]\n      # Calibrated scores\n      calibrated_mmlu: 0.842\n      calibrated_gsm8k: 0.893\n      ci_width_avg_pp: 5.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      72B 作为 single observational model（无 contamination variation），\n      γ 估计依赖于 exposure score variation across items（不同 items\n      有不同 exposure levels）。γ CI 较宽因为 single model 提供的\n      information 有限。MMLU γ CI 包含 0，consistent with 72B 在\n      MMLU 上可能 contamination 较低（或 frontier model 的 knowledge\n      已经足够高，contamination boost 可忽略）。GSM8K γ 显著大于 0\n      (CI: [0.01, 0.37])，提示即使在 72B，math reasoning benchmarks\n      仍存在 contamination concern。信号质量在 72B 是最高的（S2 0.89,\n      S4 0.84），确认 scale-dependent trend 的外推。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"72B Observational Results\"\n        headers: [\"Benchmark\", \"Raw Score\", \"Calibrated\", \"95% CI\", \"γ_k\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"85.4%\", \"84.2%\", \"[81.5, 86.9]\", \"0.12 [-0.02, 0.28]\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"90.8%\", \"89.3%\", \"[86.2, 92.4]\", \"0.18 [0.01, 0.37]\"]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", \"94.3%\", \"93.8%\", \"[91.4, 96.2]\", \"0.09 [-0.04, 0.23]\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"72B 作为 ecological validity extension 呈现在 Appendix。bar chart: raw vs calibrated with CI。\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B 结果展示 ContamCal 在 frontier scale 的适用性。calibration 调整\n      幅度小（1-1.5pp）但统计上 GSM8K 的 γ 显著不为零，说明即使\n      frontier 模型也存在可检测的 contamination signal。Signal quality\n      达到最高水平 (S2 AUC 0.89) 进一步支持 scale-dependent narrative。\n      Limitation: single model, γ estimates noisy.\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-013: Closed-Weight 2-Signal Mode\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"closed_weight_2signal_mode\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-013\"\n    description: >\n      仅 ConStat + Self-Critique (无 logits/embeddings) 的退化模式。\n      量化 2-signal vs 4-signal calibration gap。\n    expected_results:\n      # 2-signal RRF AUC (closed-weight mode)\n      rrf_2signal_auc_05B: 0.508\n      rrf_2signal_auc_15B: 0.782\n      rrf_2signal_auc_3B: 0.831\n      # Calibration with 2-signal\n      mae_2signal_05B_pp: 6.8\n      mae_2signal_15B_pp: 2.8\n      mae_2signal_3B_pp: 2.1\n      mae_2signal_avg_pp: 3.9\n      ci95_coverage_2signal: 0.86\n      # Gap vs 4-signal\n      mae_gap_4signal_vs_2signal_pp: 2.1\n      coverage_gap: 0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      0.5B 2-signal 近似失效 (AUC 0.508) 因为 S3/S4 在 0.5B 都不工作，\n      MAE 6.8pp 接近 raw baseline。1.5B 2-signal MAE 2.8pp 可用但明显\n      劣于 4-signal 的 1.4pp——信息损失约 1.4pp。3B 2-signal MAE 2.1pp\n      已较接近 4-signal 的 1.6pp（gap 仅 0.5pp），因为 S3+S4 在 3B\n      已较强 (AUC 0.83+)。Coverage 86% 低于 4-signal 的 94% 因为\n      exposure 估计噪声更大但 ME model 补偿不足。整体 2-signal 平均\n      MAE 3.9pp 与 DCR baseline 的 3.9pp 持平——说明 even in degraded\n      mode, ContamCal matches the best existing method, while providing CIs.\n    tables:\n      - name: \"4-Signal vs 2-Signal (Closed-Weight) Comparison\"\n        headers: [\"Scale\", \"4-Signal MAE\", \"2-Signal MAE\", \"Gap\", \"2-Signal AUC\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.5B\", \"2.3pp\", \"6.8pp\", \"+4.5pp\", 0.508]\n          - [\"1.5B\", \"1.4pp\", \"2.8pp\", \"+1.4pp\", 0.782]\n          - [\"3B\", \"1.6pp\", \"2.1pp\", \"+0.5pp\", 0.831]\n          - [\"Average\", \"1.8pp\", \"3.9pp\", \"+2.1pp\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4-signal vs 2-signal MAE bar chart by scale。标注 DCR baseline 作为参考线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Closed-weight mode 在 1.5B+ 仍提供有意义的 calibration (MAE 2.1-2.8pp)，\n      优于或持平 DCR。在 0.5B 时近似失效——论文应明确声明 \"closed-weight\n      mode requires ≥1.5B models for reliable calibration.\" 这是 practical\n      guidance for practitioners evaluating closed-source models。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # EXP-014: Multi-Family Validation\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"multi_family_validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.2-1B 上重复 3-dosage (d000/d025/d100) controlled\n      SFT injection。验证 cross-family generalization。\n    expected_results:\n      # Llama-3.2-1B baseline\n      llama_d000_mmlu: 0.492\n      llama_d000_gsm8k: 0.456\n      llama_d000_arc: 0.652\n      # Contamination inflation\n      llama_d025_mmlu: 0.508\n      llama_d025_gsm8k: 0.478\n      llama_d100_mmlu: 0.521\n      llama_d100_gsm8k: 0.583\n      llama_d100_arc: 0.671\n      # Signal quality\n      S1_auc_llama_d005: 0.962\n      S2_auc_llama_d005: 0.698\n      S4_auc_llama_d005: 0.671\n      # Calibration\n      calibration_mae_pp_llama: 2.1\n      ci95_coverage_llama: 0.92\n      # Cross-family consistency\n      gamma_mmlu_llama: 0.19\n      gamma_gsm8k_llama: 0.72\n      gamma_consistency_with_qwen_pearson: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.2-1B (~1B scale) 的信号质量介于 Qwen 0.5B 和 1.5B 之间\n      （S2 AUC 0.698 接近但未达 0.70 threshold），符合 scale-dependent\n      pattern。contamination inflation 模式与 Qwen 一致：GSM8K 敏感\n      (d100 +12.7pp)，MMLU 中等 (d100 +2.9pp)。γ 估计与 Qwen 高度\n      相关（Pearson 0.91）——GSM8K 仍是最易受影响的 benchmark。\n      calibration MAE 2.1pp 略高于 Qwen 1.5B 的 1.4pp 因为 Llama 1B\n      的信号质量稍低。这为 reviewer concern #11 (single model family)\n      提供 rebuttal evidence，同时确认 identifiability boundaries\n      和 benchmark-specific γ patterns generalize across families。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Family γ Comparison\"\n        headers: [\"Benchmark\", \"Qwen2.5 γ\", \"Llama-3.2 γ\", \"Difference\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", 0.22, 0.19, \"-0.03\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", 0.85, 0.72, \"-0.13\"]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", 0.18, 0.16, \"-0.02\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-family γ scatter: x=Qwen γ_k, y=Llama γ_k, 3 points (per benchmark)。高 correlation 线性趋势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Multi-family validation 确认核心发现的 generalizability。γ 跨家族\n      高度一致说明 benchmark-specific contamination susceptibility 是\n      benchmark 自身的属性（item structure, format, memorizability），\n      而非模型家族特异的。Llama 的 S2 AUC (0.698) 刚好在 0.70 threshold\n      以下，验证了 1B scale 是 Min-K++ 的 borderline regime——\n      与 simulation sweep 的 practical boundary 预测吻合。\n```\n\nSummary: 在 best 档下，11 个实验的预测结果内在一致且互相支撑。核心数字是 exp-006 的 MAE 1.8pp / coverage 94% / Kendall τ 0.96，由 exp-002/008 的多尺度信号恢复（S2 AUC 0.74@1.5B）、exp-004 的可辨识性验证（AUC≥0.70 threshold）、exp-005 的 ME 模型 coverage gap closure 共同支撑。三条 Claims 均有充分实验证据，无需降级。","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"93e56223-49e0-4a11-b4de-68f1c155e35a","total_cost_usd":1.9140758500000006,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":59650,"cache_read_input_tokens":215739,"output_tokens":45831,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":59650,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":28084,"cache_read_input_tokens":64290,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7201,"cache_creation":{"ephe